(972265, 115207, 27293, '<td valign="top">!!! I would move the camera to the right, make the breast the center of the shot, figuratively speaking. Also there is some digital noise or JPEG artifacs that need to be cleaned up. Therefore 8.</td>', '!!! I would move the camera to the right, make the breast the center of the shot, figuratively speaking. Also there is some digital noise or JPEG artifacs that need to be cleaned up. Therefore 8.', '2004-10-25 01:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
