(972708, 114932, 16004, '<td valign="top">this would make a great album sleeve - actually, it has strong reminisces of a led zeppelin cover.  anyway, i do like the symmetry and repitition in this A lot.  regards to fitting the challenge, i can''t decide if the lines are implied or not...   i think the white ones are, but the beige ones are not. so, yes, it fits.  i do wsh it were a little bit sharper though.  7.</td>', 'this would make a great album sleeve - actually, it has strong reminisces of a led zeppelin cover.  anyway, i do like the symmetry and repitition in this A lot.  regards to fitting the challenge, i can''t decide if the lines are implied or not...   i think the white ones are, but the beige ones are not. so, yes, it fits.  i do wsh it were a little bit sharper though.  7.', '2004-10-25 09:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(972715, 115338, 13610, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is real god but with more DOF the lines created by the fence would have been more apparent. Can''t really see them that way.</td>', 'I think the idea is real god but with more DOF the lines created by the fence would have been more apparent. Can''t really see them that way.', '2004-10-25 09:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(972717, 115154, 3724, '<td valign="top">Slightly deviating linear arcs of  dimensiioned dots create an optical contour on the serface of the monitor which is interesting... .  the orange to green gradient adds to the effect.   A really excellent Op study, and very good work.</td>', 'Slightly deviating linear arcs of  dimensiioned dots create an optical contour on the serface of the monitor which is interesting... .  the orange to green gradient adds to the effect.   A really excellent Op study, and very good work.', '2004-10-25 09:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
