(972734, 115215, 16004, '<td valign="top">it fits the challenge, no question, though the middle guy is ruining your endeavours a little bit (and he''s trying to jump the start!).  i can imagine difficult choices were made with regards to cropping - i think for the most part you''ve got it right, but i might have been tempted to either a) crop level with the top of the concrete wall (thereby losing the distracting biker the other side) or b) cropping higher including more of the bikes, such as handle bars...  very tough decision.  overall i like it - it''s original and quite gripping.  7.</td>', 'it fits the challenge, no question, though the middle guy is ruining your endeavours a little bit (and he''s trying to jump the start!).  i can imagine difficult choices were made with regards to cropping - i think for the most part you''ve got it right, but i might have been tempted to either a) crop level with the top of the concrete wall (thereby losing the distracting biker the other side) or b) cropping higher including more of the bikes, such as handle bars...  very tough decision.  overall i like it - it''s original and quite gripping.  7.', '2004-10-25 10:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
