(972796, 114970, 16004, '<td valign="top">what an obscure choice of subject - very clever!  this is such a case of getting the challenge nailed down - bravo!  it''s alos quite stylish - the graininess works for me (though it''s probably not grainy, just the ripples on the water), and the B&amp;W a good move...   the feeling of loneliness, solitude, but a happy peace is oozing from my screen right now.  very emotional shot - 9.</td>', 'what an obscure choice of subject - very clever!  this is such a case of getting the challenge nailed down - bravo!  it''s alos quite stylish - the graininess works for me (though it''s probably not grainy, just the ripples on the water), and the B&W a good move...   the feeling of loneliness, solitude, but a happy peace is oozing from my screen right now.  very emotional shot - 9.', '2004-10-25 11:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
