(972799, 114391, 16004, '<td valign="top">to me, the lines aren''t particularly implied - even though they''re not p[hysically there to touch, the lines are full lines which aren''t implied so much as, erm, there.  THAT aside, it doesn''t feel all that special from the other rainbow shots there have been - i guess the colours of the subject in question feel a bit muted.  added radiance (from selective brightness and contrast) might have enhanced this picture.  good, but not that inspiring.  5.</td>', 'to me, the lines aren''t particularly implied - even though they''re not p[hysically there to touch, the lines are full lines which aren''t implied so much as, erm, there.  THAT aside, it doesn''t feel all that special from the other rainbow shots there have been - i guess the colours of the subject in question feel a bit muted.  added radiance (from selective brightness and contrast) might have enhanced this picture.  good, but not that inspiring.  5.', '2004-10-25 11:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(972806, 114955, 318, '<td valign="top">This one will probably score lower than it deserves. 1. Fits the subject. 2. Great matching colours. 3. Simplicity. Shame about the frame, though.</td>', 'This one will probably score lower than it deserves. 1. Fits the subject. 2. Great matching colours. 3. Simplicity. Shame about the frame, though.', '2004-10-25 11:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(972808, 115173, 12417, '<td valign="top">it''s either too dark or not dark enough. My eyes don''t like the photograph as much when they meet the tree line above water... 6</td>', 'it''s either too dark or not dark enough. My eyes don''t like the photograph as much when they meet the tree line above water... 6', '2004-10-25 11:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(972809, 114798, 318, '<td valign="top">Green, Yellow, Red. There are two lines in one there. Great capture.</td>', 'Green, Yellow, Red. There are two lines in one there. Great capture.', '2004-10-25 11:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(972810, 115285, 3569, '<td valign="top">and even the big dipper, nice</td>', 'and even the big dipper, nice', '2004-10-25 11:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(972815, 115329, 19010, '<td valign="top">I thinks this would do better on implied lines if you had shown more of the "neck line" otherwise nice shot....</td>', 'I thinks this would do better on implied lines if you had shown more of the "neck line" otherwise nice shot....', '2004-10-25 11:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(972820, 114667, 19010, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a lot better if you had cropped out the bottom of this photo and left only the tops of the highest roof the hills and the cranes. Heck they might of even asked for you to validate it assuming you cloned the cranes to get them so perfectly lined up...</td>', 'I think this would have been a lot better if you had cropped out the bottom of this photo and left only the tops of the highest roof the hills and the cranes. Heck they might of even asked for you to validate it assuming you cloned the cranes to get them so perfectly lined up...', '2004-10-25 11:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(972822, 114599, 19010, '<td valign="top">I think I would have used a chess theme in the title but other than that I liked the photo.</td>', 'I think I would have used a chess theme in the title but other than that I liked the photo.', '2004-10-25 11:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(972824, 114622, 26847, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  Well executed.  But, the title is the only thing that forces us to see lines in the photo.  Yes, if I try REALLY REALLY hard I can see lines in the picture.  This one seems to be too much of a stretch to me.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  Well executed.  But, the title is the only thing that forces us to see lines in the photo.  Yes, if I try REALLY REALLY hard I can see lines in the picture.  This one seems to be too much of a stretch to me.', '2004-10-25 11:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(972827, 115154, 26847, '<td valign="top">Sharpening your photos will be a tremendous help.</td>', 'Sharpening your photos will be a tremendous help.', '2004-10-25 11:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(972829, 114699, 19010, '<td valign="top">I feel the picture could have been a litle more in focus. I love the color. I do however feel sorry fot you if that is realy your yard....that looks like plenty of work.</td>', 'I feel the picture could have been a litle more in focus. I love the color. I do however feel sorry fot you if that is realy your yard....that looks like plenty of work.', '2004-10-25 11:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(972834, 114156, 26847, '<td valign="top">Deeper focus would help this photo significantly.  Excellent subject matter, however.</td>', 'Deeper focus would help this photo significantly.  Excellent subject matter, however.', '2004-10-25 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(972836, 114488, 26847, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  But the focus, color, lighting and contrast are all detractors from the photo.</td>', 'Great subject.  But the focus, color, lighting and contrast are all detractors from the photo.', '2004-10-25 11:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(972837, 115349, 318, '<td valign="top">There are websites that specalize in crappy jokes. This is not one of them. Please do not waste our time and bandwidth.</td>', 'There are websites that specalize in crappy jokes. This is not one of them. Please do not waste our time and bandwidth.', '2004-10-25 11:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(972839, 115200, 26847, '<td valign="top">Glasses aren''t truly equidistant from each other.  Also, burn in the third glass so it has the same blacks and richness of the first two.  Lastly, consider making their arrangement even deeper.  Right now they''re a bit tight and the negative space to their right is distracting and doesn''t represent any element of visual language.</td>', 'Glasses aren''t truly equidistant from each other.  Also, burn in the third glass so it has the same blacks and richness of the first two.  Lastly, consider making their arrangement even deeper.  Right now they''re a bit tight and the negative space to their right is distracting and doesn''t represent any element of visual language.', '2004-10-25 11:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(972841, 115325, 25017, '<td valign="top">stunning and emotional wow! well done</td>', 'stunning and emotional wow! well done', '2004-10-25 11:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(972842, 115152, 25017, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot, would so love to see this for myself well captured</td>', 'fantastic shot, would so love to see this for myself well captured', '2004-10-25 11:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(972846, 115152, 19943, '<td valign="top">Wow!  How can we compete with that?!?!  Good DOF.  If the colors of the image were good, I probably would not have chosen B&amp;W.  However, I gave you a 10 (my only one in this challenge) because you met the challenge criteria, captured a very unique composition, and made it all work.  Great job.</td>', 'Wow!  How can we compete with that?!?!  Good DOF.  If the colors of the image were good, I probably would not have chosen B&W.  However, I gave you a 10 (my only one in this challenge) because you met the challenge criteria, captured a very unique composition, and made it all work.  Great job.', '2004-10-25 11:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(972848, 115298, 26847, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter.  But your composition is so neutral that it undermines any drama.  The result is it feels like a well lit snap shot.</td>', 'Great subject matter.  But your composition is so neutral that it undermines any drama.  The result is it feels like a well lit snap shot.', '2004-10-25 11:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(972849, 114597, 19943, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF, colors, and clarity.  The fence-line and road lead your eye into the picture very well.  I might have flipped the picture so the left front corner is the start point for the fence/road.  I gave you my only (9) for taking a great picture.  Good work.</td>', 'Very nice DOF, colors, and clarity.  The fence-line and road lead your eye into the picture very well.  I might have flipped the picture so the left front corner is the start point for the fence/road.  I gave you my only (9) for taking a great picture.  Good work.', '2004-10-25 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(972850, 114587, 19010, '<td valign="top">To dark.  think I would have raised the btightness, and then contrast to bring out more detail, and to still leave the dak glooms feel I figure you were shooting for. As is i just so a couple of poorly lit signs.</td>', 'To dark.  think I would have raised the btightness, and then contrast to bring out more detail, and to still leave the dak glooms feel I figure you were shooting for. As is i just so a couple of poorly lit signs.', '2004-10-25 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(972851, 115339, 26847, '<td valign="top">so soft that I have to vote very low.  I''m sorry.</td>', 'so soft that I have to vote very low.  I''m sorry.', '2004-10-25 11:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(972853, 115330, 26847, '<td valign="top">Nice color and light.  However, I don''t see any lines in this at all.  Submitting this is a massive stretch for the subject.</td>', 'Nice color and light.  However, I don''t see any lines in this at all.  Submitting this is a massive stretch for the subject.', '2004-10-25 11:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(972855, 115257, 19010, '<td valign="top">interesting enough feature. However I feel this could have been in focus a little more.</td>', 'interesting enough feature. However I feel this could have been in focus a little more.', '2004-10-25 11:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(972856, 114022, 19943, '<td valign="top">OOF, bad DOF, poor choice for this challenge (or any other challenge I would expect).</td>', 'OOF, bad DOF, poor choice for this challenge (or any other challenge I would expect).', '2004-10-25 11:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(972857, 115320, 22533, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. A foreground object would make it even better!</td>', 'Beautiful. A foreground object would make it even better!', '2004-10-25 11:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(972858, 115139, 19010, '<td valign="top">nice shot but what caused the ugly shadow at the bottom?</td>', 'nice shot but what caused the ugly shadow at the bottom?', '2004-10-25 11:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(972859, 114859, 26847, '<td valign="top">I see a B-mass.  I see a B-curve.  I see a B-squiggle.  I don''t see a B-line.  Additionally, the focus is way to shallow and the lense flare in the upper left hand corner doesn''t help the image.  It feels accidental.</td>', 'I see a B-mass.  I see a B-curve.  I see a B-squiggle.  I don''t see a B-line.  Additionally, the focus is way to shallow and the lense flare in the upper left hand corner doesn''t help the image.  It feels accidental.', '2004-10-25 11:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(972860, 115186, 19943, '<td valign="top">Come on, you can do better than this (unless you''re shooting for the brown ribbon).  Lighting is bad, not focused well, awful subject matter, doesn''t fit the challenge criteria.  I scored you up a little for a unique idea.  Keep trying.</td>', 'Come on, you can do better than this (unless you''re shooting for the brown ribbon).  Lighting is bad, not focused well, awful subject matter, doesn''t fit the challenge criteria.  I scored you up a little for a unique idea.  Keep trying.', '2004-10-25 11:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(972862, 114968, 19010, '<td valign="top">hmm its not often a big white glare like spot actualy adds to the photo..</td>', 'hmm its not often a big white glare like spot actualy adds to the photo..', '2004-10-25 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(972863, 114934, 16004, '<td valign="top">well done for complying with the challenge!  the flow of the image is disrupted slightly by the cherokee right at the back (you could have cropped it there and given the impression that this would have gone on ad infinitum).  certain aspect i particularly like include the reflection on the rear windows, and especially the unifomity of the whole thing.  the sky is a little blown out (if you aim towards the sky and then lower the camera half pressed, it might come out less white).  that aside very good.  8.</td>', 'well done for complying with the challenge!  the flow of the image is disrupted slightly by the cherokee right at the back (you could have cropped it there and given the impression that this would have gone on ad infinitum).  certain aspect i particularly like include the reflection on the rear windows, and especially the unifomity of the whole thing.  the sky is a little blown out (if you aim towards the sky and then lower the camera half pressed, it might come out less white).  that aside very good.  8.', '2004-10-25 11:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(972865, 114798, 22533, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but the sign is distracting.</td>', 'Beautiful, but the sign is distracting.', '2004-10-25 11:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
