(972869, 115152, 19010, '<td valign="top">seems a little grainy. otherwise awsom shot. where was this taken? I didnt think that there was that many "terakota?" soldiers in one area.</td>', 'seems a little grainy. otherwise awsom shot. where was this taken? I didnt think that there was that many "terakota?" soldiers in one area.', '2004-10-25 11:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(972872, 114954, 19010, '<td valign="top">good grief thats bright i can''t even tell if its a road or a river. I do like the pretty fall colors however</td>', 'good grief thats bright i can''t even tell if its a road or a river. I do like the pretty fall colors however', '2004-10-25 11:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
