(972900, 115327, 17103, '<td valign="top">Wow, they are just so cool looking!  Great shot of these little creatures.  And I can see the implied line in this photo, too.  Hooray!!  :)</td>', 'Wow, they are just so cool looking!  Great shot of these little creatures.  And I can see the implied line in this photo, too.  Hooray!!  :)', '2004-10-25 12:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
