(973115, 115207, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now, this is a lovely image very well lit and very well composed and the mark I give it is based solely on the quality. However, the lines here are literal and not at all implied. One can argue that the hair strands break up the shape of the breast, but while this is true, the effect is more of a mask rather than implied lines. 5</td>', 'Now, this is a lovely image very well lit and very well composed and the mark I give it is based solely on the quality. However, the lines here are literal and not at all implied. One can argue that the hair strands break up the shape of the breast, but while this is true, the effect is more of a mask rather than implied lines. 5', '2004-10-25 15:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
