(973120, 114718, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good study but truly, these lines are very literal and one has to look gard to find the very few that break up and are therefore implied. Since it is a good image ny vote is based solely on this virtue. 5</td>', 'A very good study but truly, these lines are very literal and one has to look gard to find the very few that break up and are therefore implied. Since it is a good image ny vote is based solely on this virtue. 5', '2004-10-25 15:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
