(973126, 114795, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image fits the challenge but it has a static feel. My two cents for improvement would be to get up close to the first  gravestone on the right and shoot it and make iy a perpective study. 5</td>', 'This image fits the challenge but it has a static feel. My two cents for improvement would be to get up close to the first  gravestone on the right and shoot it and make iy a perpective study. 5', '2004-10-25 15:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(973131, 115330, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very haunting and beautiful image but missing the implied lines required. Of course, one can argue that the sun breaking past the cloids create lines, but these lines are more literal than implied. One can even say that the distant land creates a line, but this can also be said of the rock formation, yet while this weak dose exist they fall short. Again, the image is great and my vote reflects this quiality. 5</td>', 'A very haunting and beautiful image but missing the implied lines required. Of course, one can argue that the sun breaking past the cloids create lines, but these lines are more literal than implied. One can even say that the distant land creates a line, but this can also be said of the rock formation, yet while this weak dose exist they fall short. Again, the image is great and my vote reflects this quiality. 5', '2004-10-25 15:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
