(973146, 115315, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a study which required more attention. I am guilty of this, so what i say applies to us both. The idea is superb but you are presenting the eye with one implied line to put together. Why not continue the matches around to form a U. This would give the study a perpective variation and a pleasing line ro bring the eye back into the image. I would have also considered some alternate takes with lighting. You get a 5 for meeting the challenge and 1 more for concept. 6</td>', 'This is a study which required more attention. I am guilty of this, so what i say applies to us both. The idea is superb but you are presenting the eye with one implied line to put together. Why not continue the matches around to form a U. This would give the study a perpective variation and a pleasing line ro bring the eye back into the image. I would have also considered some alternate takes with lighting. You get a 5 for meeting the challenge and 1 more for concept. 6', '2004-10-25 15:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(973147, 115267, 19943, '<td valign="top">I gave you an 8 for a really cool shot.  Unfortunate that the horizon (floor) is tilted and the bottom third of the image is too dark (maybe a flash would brighten the foreground).</td>', 'I gave you an 8 for a really cool shot.  Unfortunate that the horizon (floor) is tilted and the bottom third of the image is too dark (maybe a flash would brighten the foreground).', '2004-10-25 15:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
