(973168, 114599, 27524, '<td valign="top">Horses are interesting...but I wonder why you didnt croped that stick off.</td>', 'Horses are interesting...but I wonder why you didnt croped that stick off.', '2004-10-25 15:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(973169, 114350, 11800, '<td valign="top">I might be forced to vote on this challenge just to give this picture the ten it deserves.  I hate when my picks don''t win, and feel somewhat guilty about it. Great sculpture. Thanks for sharing it with us.</td>', 'I might be forced to vote on this challenge just to give this picture the ten it deserves.  I hate when my picks don''t win, and feel somewhat guilty about it. Great sculpture. Thanks for sharing it with us.', '2004-10-25 15:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(973173, 115070, 11800, '<td valign="top">oof. Not a bad idea though.</td>', 'oof. Not a bad idea though.', '2004-10-25 15:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(973175, 113926, 27524, '<td valign="top">Wonderful bright colors but i heard its not good compozition to make it half half.</td>', 'Wonderful bright colors but i heard its not good compozition to make it half half.', '2004-10-25 15:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(973176, 115236, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative low key study with a lovely artistic feel. Yet, the implied arcs as presented by the fingers is not something the eye seeks to resolve. The mind does seek to form a whole out of the parts. But the interest to do so is to solve the immediate riddle of that which appears scattered. Here the image does not compel the mind to complete the arcs as they are not essential to understanding the image. Hate me, 5 for meeting challenge and 1 for artistic take. 6</td>', 'This is a very creative low key study with a lovely artistic feel. Yet, the implied arcs as presented by the fingers is not something the eye seeks to resolve. The mind does seek to form a whole out of the parts. But the interest to do so is to solve the immediate riddle of that which appears scattered. Here the image does not compel the mind to complete the arcs as they are not essential to understanding the image. Hate me, 5 for meeting challenge and 1 for artistic take. 6', '2004-10-25 15:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(973177, 114587, 22734, '<td valign="top">A good concept but it could have used a more interetsing rendition. As is, it remains very static. 5</td>', 'A good concept but it could have used a more interetsing rendition. As is, it remains very static. 5', '2004-10-25 15:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(973178, 114590, 27524, '<td valign="top">Oh people...somebody have snow already. Well normaly we could too...<br/>I like this a lot cuz you really have to find the trees between others and snow make it even better. Good luck.</td>', 'Oh people...somebody have snow already. Well normaly we could too...I like this a lot cuz you really have to find the trees between others and snow make it even better. Good luck.', '2004-10-25 15:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(973180, 115154, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  Look at the center portion. See how the red seems to bulge out of the holes. That is the essence of implied lines. My mind creates an illusion of volume from the information the eyes feed it. I bet this doesn''t get the prize, but it should. Btw, I like it better with the lower 1/3 cropped out. good luck.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  Look at the center portion. See how the red seems to bulge out of the holes. That is the essence of implied lines. My mind creates an illusion of volume from the information the eyes feed it. I bet this doesn''t get the prize, but it should. Btw, I like it better with the lower 1/3 cropped out. good luck.', '2004-10-25 15:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(973182, 114590, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image with with ultra subtle implied lines. It is like the eyes have to go beneath the bushes to find the baselines and travel the tresversed path to find them in the foliage. Yet, it is a good image. 5</td>', 'A very interesting image with with ultra subtle implied lines. It is like the eyes have to go beneath the bushes to find the baselines and travel the tresversed path to find them in the foliage. Yet, it is a good image. 5', '2004-10-25 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(973184, 115200, 27524, '<td valign="top">Yes...glases always look good. Good focus and nice blured bacground.</td>', 'Yes...glases always look good. Good focus and nice blured bacground.', '2004-10-25 15:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(973187, 114912, 22734, '<td valign="top">A nice study but representation of implied lines are so subtle they are almost invisible.5</td>', 'A nice study but representation of implied lines are so subtle they are almost invisible.5', '2004-10-25 16:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(973190, 115271, 22734, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image with lovely sensual tones, but the lines, although supposely reflected are very literal and not implied. The saving factor are the three stones which imply one line with the help of of the ore.  Implied lines are the ones the eyes connect to make a whole. Quality of image with one implied line 6</td>', 'A beautiful image with lovely sensual tones, but the lines, although supposely reflected are very literal and not implied. The saving factor are the three stones which imply one line with the help of of the ore.  Implied lines are the ones the eyes connect to make a whole. Quality of image with one implied line 6', '2004-10-25 16:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(973195, 115061, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image meets the challenge but it lacks color interest. 5</td>', 'This image meets the challenge but it lacks color interest. 5', '2004-10-25 16:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(973198, 114350, 27524, '<td valign="top">This is cool... real original and well captured... like sepia and those colors in clowds...like diving in dark city. Good luck.</td>', 'This is cool... real original and well captured... like sepia and those colors in clowds...like diving in dark city. Good luck.', '2004-10-25 16:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(973200, 115312, 11800, '<td valign="top">More than likely, you have a ton of comments about the frame. I''m not going to tell you not to use them, but I will tell you why I hate this particular style of frame. It looks like one of those little buttons they used to make for diy websites or those buttons you can have made to wear with your kids picture on it. I don''t deduct points for frames though.<br/>The picture. I like the shadows of the fences. The composition is a bit static. Too centered(the left fence is the problem) and the road leads to a stop sign. Could use a little more saturation and contrast.</td>', 'More than likely, you have a ton of comments about the frame. I''m not going to tell you not to use them, but I will tell you why I hate this particular style of frame. It looks like one of those little buttons they used to make for diy websites or those buttons you can have made to wear with your kids picture on it. I don''t deduct points for frames though.The picture. I like the shadows of the fences. The composition is a bit static. Too centered(the left fence is the problem) and the road leads to a stop sign. Could use a little more saturation and contrast.', '2004-10-25 16:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(973201, 114875, 22734, '<td valign="top">Implied lines assited by literal lines. like belt and suspenders.lol Very nice, but a later time it would have yielded a horizon of mostly impled lines. Nice capture.</td>', 'Implied lines assited by literal lines. like belt and suspenders.lol Very nice, but a later time it would have yielded a horizon of mostly impled lines. Nice capture.', '2004-10-25 16:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(973204, 114953, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely image, yet the eye looks for the implied. Since the eyes do not bother to close the dots on the horizon, nor ever to with clouds. we are left with a beautiful image with a lovely sky. It is on this virtue that I vote. 5</td>', 'A lovely image, yet the eye looks for the implied. Since the eyes do not bother to close the dots on the horizon, nor ever to with clouds. we are left with a beautiful image with a lovely sky. It is on this virtue that I vote. 5', '2004-10-25 16:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(973207, 114802, 5354, '<td valign="top">You have the blue ribbon here, no doubt about it.</td>', 'You have the blue ribbon here, no doubt about it.', '2004-10-25 16:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
