(973211, 114929, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like the mystery of it. Who lived there? How long ago. What is the climate like. Warm? Colors good, night flash good, framing good. The only imperfect thing is the weed to the left, imo. I would have bent it out of the way. I like the savage/civilized implication.</td>', 'Very interesting. I like the mystery of it. Who lived there? How long ago. What is the climate like. Warm? Colors good, night flash good, framing good. The only imperfect thing is the weed to the left, imo. I would have bent it out of the way. I like the savage/civilized implication.', '2004-10-25 16:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(973213, 114629, 27524, '<td valign="top">Good idea with this... nice focus too. Looks artistic in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Good idea with this... nice focus too. Looks artistic in B&W.', '2004-10-25 16:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(973217, 114675, 22734, '<td valign="top">All lines here are certainly literal and not implied. The composition is interesting with nice colors and only on this basis is my vote geared to. 5</td>', 'All lines here are certainly literal and not implied. The composition is interesting with nice colors and only on this basis is my vote geared to. 5', '2004-10-25 16:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
