(973221, 114400, 11800, '<td valign="top">Pretty place but it looks oof. This might almost be a soft focus effect, but it lacks the glow that the technique usually displays. The plants are a unique color.</td>', 'Pretty place but it looks oof. This might almost be a soft focus effect, but it lacks the glow that the technique usually displays. The plants are a unique color.', '2004-10-25 16:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
