(973368, 115223, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strength of challenge link: strong<br/> <br/>Image critique: weak subject but good composition. Tones and lighting aren''t very engaging though, so overall not a captivating photo.</td>', 'Strength of challenge link: strong Image critique: weak subject but good composition. Tones and lighting aren''t very engaging though, so overall not a captivating photo.', '2004-10-25 18:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(973369, 115217, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strength of challenge link: medium<br/> <br/>Image critique: the set-up is not wildy creative, so not very engaging really. Focus is quite narrow and I''m not sure what I''m supposed to look at or feel about the photo.</td>', 'Strength of challenge link: medium Image critique: the set-up is not wildy creative, so not very engaging really. Focus is quite narrow and I''m not sure what I''m supposed to look at or feel about the photo.', '2004-10-25 18:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(973373, 114934, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strength of challenge link: medium<br/> <br/>Image critique: yes, there is a line of vehicles, but otherwise this doesn''t grab me. There''s nothing particularly creative about the way this is shot or the subject itself. Crouching low down )away from eye-level) would at least offer a different viewpoint and may present some more intrigue with shapes of wheels, etc.</td>', 'Strength of challenge link: medium Image critique: yes, there is a line of vehicles, but otherwise this doesn''t grab me. There''s nothing particularly creative about the way this is shot or the subject itself. Crouching low down )away from eye-level) would at least offer a different viewpoint and may present some more intrigue with shapes of wheels, etc.', '2004-10-25 18:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(973375, 115255, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strength of challenge link: weak (lines are literal)<br/> <br/>Image critique: dynamic viewpoint, but ultimately quite a dull scene and looks more like a snapshot. Shot lower to the seating this could have been more unusual.</td>', 'Strength of challenge link: weak (lines are literal) Image critique: dynamic viewpoint, but ultimately quite a dull scene and looks more like a snapshot. Shot lower to the seating this could have been more unusual.', '2004-10-25 18:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(973378, 115244, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strength of challenge link: medium<br/> <br/>Image critique: strong composition and powerful colour. I''m just not sure what I should think about it though - why is it an illusion, I don''t see it?</td>', 'Strength of challenge link: medium Image critique: strong composition and powerful colour. I''m just not sure what I should think about it though - why is it an illusion, I don''t see it?', '2004-10-25 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(973387, 115338, 28070, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot, I like it.  Implied lines however I don''t know. The spaces in the fence, but there is not enough of them and focus is great for the leaf but the lines aren''t bold enough through my eyes.</td>', 'This is a cool shot, I like it.  Implied lines however I don''t know. The spaces in the fence, but there is not enough of them and focus is great for the leaf but the lines aren''t bold enough through my eyes.', '2004-10-25 18:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
