(973619, 113954, 12253, '<td valign="top">I am not sure we are talking about telephone lines, but I guess there are many interpretations. And of course, there are other geometric implied lines here. <br/> <br/>As to the composition, iIn this nice closeup, I find the extreme blur on the right VERY distracting.  Oddly enough, perhaps because it''s light, my eyes are drawn to it rather than the focal point.  But it''s so blurry that it kind of "hurts" your eyes.</td>', 'I am not sure we are talking about telephone lines, but I guess there are many interpretations. And of course, there are other geometric implied lines here.  As to the composition, iIn this nice closeup, I find the extreme blur on the right VERY distracting.  Oddly enough, perhaps because it''s light, my eyes are drawn to it rather than the focal point.  But it''s so blurry that it kind of "hurts" your eyes.', '2004-10-25 21:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
