(973636, 115067, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and of course one could say the objects are lined up.  However, from this perspective there''s nothing that makes the eye "see the line", as you would see from a different perspective.  They are not particularly associated.  Still, I understand why you took and submitted this: I love the way the light is reflected from the water when I am out at this time of day, and you''ve captured that beaitully.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and of course one could say the objects are lined up.  However, from this perspective there''s nothing that makes the eye "see the line", as you would see from a different perspective.  They are not particularly associated.  Still, I understand why you took and submitted this: I love the way the light is reflected from the water when I am out at this time of day, and you''ve captured that beaitully.', '2004-10-25 21:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
