(973996, 115061, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice place for shoot. One of first i think should have taken it in between the row...without these front sticks...there would be nice and closer look on strawberry leaves and even some berries. Second thing that i would croped top part with trees till the begining of strawberry field...that would give more accent on field. Nice work, keep shoting.</td>', 'Nice place for shoot. One of first i think should have taken it in between the row...without these front sticks...there would be nice and closer look on strawberry leaves and even some berries. Second thing that i would croped top part with trees till the begining of strawberry field...that would give more accent on field. Nice work, keep shoting.', '2004-10-26 04:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
