(975254, 115189, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this is a clever depiction of implied line.  I hope you do well with it, but based on how I think DPC voters judge challenges, I''m not sure that you will.</td>', 'I think this is a clever depiction of implied line.  I hope you do well with it, but based on how I think DPC voters judge challenges, I''m not sure that you will.', '2004-10-27 00:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(975263, 115333, 18799, '<td valign="top">This a nice, tranquil photo, but I''m not sure where the implied line(s) is/are.  If it''s the trees, I don''t think there are enough of them, nor are they compositionally important enough to be considered.  If it''s the shore line, I think it''s more of an actual line.   As for the composition, my opinion is that the photo would have been more effective if you had stepped a little to the left and had more of an angle to the river back, creating more a diagonal to pull the viewer through the picture.  The straight line is a little to direct, leaving the eye with nowhere to go in the image.  I hope you understand what I''m trying to convey here.  But in any eveny, it''s just an opinion.</td>', 'This a nice, tranquil photo, but I''m not sure where the implied line(s) is/are.  If it''s the trees, I don''t think there are enough of them, nor are they compositionally important enough to be considered.  If it''s the shore line, I think it''s more of an actual line.   As for the composition, my opinion is that the photo would have been more effective if you had stepped a little to the left and had more of an angle to the river back, creating more a diagonal to pull the viewer through the picture.  The straight line is a little to direct, leaving the eye with nowhere to go in the image.  I hope you understand what I''m trying to convey here.  But in any eveny, it''s just an opinion.', '2004-10-27 00:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(975278, 114798, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think the implied line in this photo is not very evident.  Maybe if you showed the entire trunk, or took it from a different angle.   The fact that the trees are cut off short leaves me wanting more from the picture.</td>', 'I think the implied line in this photo is not very evident.  Maybe if you showed the entire trunk, or took it from a different angle.   The fact that the trees are cut off short leaves me wanting more from the picture.', '2004-10-27 00:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(975280, 114978, 18799, '<td valign="top">These look like real lines to me. Other than they are not implied lines, I like the composition and exposure of this picture.</td>', 'These look like real lines to me. Other than they are not implied lines, I like the composition and exposure of this picture.', '2004-10-27 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(975797, 114874, 16004, '<td valign="top">hmmm, it certainly fits the challenge.  I like the look of this shot, and the graininess too.  Though I wonder if this might be one of the few justifiable cases for selective desaturation?  also, i think a landscaped orientaiton (with less ceiling and floor visible) might have helped drawing your eye along the picutres thereby emphasising the implied lines.  It''s a good arty concept though.  6.</td>', 'hmmm, it certainly fits the challenge.  I like the look of this shot, and the graininess too.  Though I wonder if this might be one of the few justifiable cases for selective desaturation?  also, i think a landscaped orientaiton (with less ceiling and floor visible) might have helped drawing your eye along the picutres thereby emphasising the implied lines.  It''s a good arty concept though.  6.', '2004-10-27 06:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(975801, 115336, 16004, '<td valign="top">Great shot, lovely depth of field, composition and colours.  Not entirely sure if there are any lines that are only implied...   it''s very nice, and the splash of red brings something special to what is a pretty common-themed photo.  7.</td>', 'Great shot, lovely depth of field, composition and colours.  Not entirely sure if there are any lines that are only implied...   it''s very nice, and the splash of red brings something special to what is a pretty common-themed photo.  7.', '2004-10-27 06:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
