(976650, 114384, 25486, '<td valign="top">I gave this a six based on the fact that it above average. The reason being its tightly cropped and fills the frame with the subject. The subject is not ''ordinary", its colourful, the angle gives added interest.  But somehow the focusing seems a bit off.  Perhaps a greater DOF or manual focusing if posible would have helped.  Its a very good attempt, well done.</td>', 'I gave this a six based on the fact that it above average. The reason being its tightly cropped and fills the frame with the subject. The subject is not ''ordinary", its colourful, the angle gives added interest.  But somehow the focusing seems a bit off.  Perhaps a greater DOF or manual focusing if posible would have helped.  Its a very good attempt, well done.', '2004-10-27 16:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(976664, 115154, 25486, '<td valign="top">I feel as if I should know what this is but I don''t. Anyway there are cetainly implied lines. Its interestingly lit, I don''t know if that is what gives it the colour.  Unfortunately it somehow lacks overall interest and the picture seems ''flat'', no depth to it. But a good efort and certainly worth a six, well done.</td>', 'I feel as if I should know what this is but I don''t. Anyway there are cetainly implied lines. Its interestingly lit, I don''t know if that is what gives it the colour.  Unfortunately it somehow lacks overall interest and the picture seems ''flat'', no depth to it. But a good efort and certainly worth a six, well done.', '2004-10-27 16:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(976673, 114586, 25486, '<td valign="top">A predictable subject but I don''t blame you for entering this one because it is above average the colours are good and the shot has obvious depth to it. A six from me, well done.</td>', 'A predictable subject but I don''t blame you for entering this one because it is above average the colours are good and the shot has obvious depth to it. A six from me, well done.', '2004-10-27 16:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(976675, 114979, 25486, '<td valign="top">Original subject for this challenge, might have worked better with all the pins in focus?  Just not quite enough interest in the shot for me to give it higher than 6.</td>', 'Original subject for this challenge, might have worked better with all the pins in focus?  Just not quite enough interest in the shot for me to give it higher than 6.', '2004-10-27 16:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(976682, 115271, 25486, '<td valign="top">Original and well thought of.  I don''t think the jewelry add to the shot, in fact with it disappearing out of the frame it becomes a distraction.  The lighting seems a bit ''flat'' IMO.  Very good efort though, well done.</td>', 'Original and well thought of.  I don''t think the jewelry add to the shot, in fact with it disappearing out of the frame it becomes a distraction.  The lighting seems a bit ''flat'' IMO.  Very good efort though, well done.', '2004-10-27 16:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(976686, 114350, 25486, '<td valign="top">There are some implied lines in this shot, its well framed and I like the angle it show at.  I scored all the shots then came back to comment later.  On second viewing I wondered if I''d picked it just for the ''comedy'' element.  But on second thoughts the figures do add interest and it is well shot.  Good work.</td>', 'There are some implied lines in this shot, its well framed and I like the angle it show at.  I scored all the shots then came back to comment later.  On second viewing I wondered if I''d picked it just for the ''comedy'' element.  But on second thoughts the figures do add interest and it is well shot.  Good work.', '2004-10-27 16:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(976701, 114667, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this but think it would have been even better in color</td>', 'I really like this but think it would have been even better in color', '2004-10-27 17:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(976725, 114954, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great colours, just a shame about the overcast sky.</td>', 'Great colours, just a shame about the overcast sky.', '2004-10-27 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
