(977984, 114963, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow... I am picturing you setting this one up... You''ve just about got it and you accidently bump one of the eggs... oh no! Start all over again. ;) So if nothing else, I commend you on your patience. Now when I look at the image itself I think, this is very very cool! I love all those interacting shadows. This is a 10 in my book. Ann</td>', 'Wow... I am picturing you setting this one up... You''ve just about got it and you accidently bump one of the eggs... oh no! Start all over again. ;) So if nothing else, I commend you on your patience. Now when I look at the image itself I think, this is very very cool! I love all those interacting shadows. This is a 10 in my book. Ann', '2004-10-28 16:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(977985, 114825, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great idea well executed.</td>', 'Great idea well executed.', '2004-10-28 16:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(977987, 115263, 22046, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where this is but it reminds me of one of my brother''s etchings of the Finnish woods. Very nice indeed.</td>', 'I don''t know where this is but it reminds me of one of my brother''s etchings of the Finnish woods. Very nice indeed.', '2004-10-28 16:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(977990, 115335, 22046, '<td valign="top">Took awhile for me to see the line of light. But when I did I decided to bump up my rating. This is a beautiful photograph.</td>', 'Took awhile for me to see the line of light. But when I did I decided to bump up my rating. This is a beautiful photograph.', '2004-10-28 16:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(977995, 113926, 22046, '<td valign="top">I really like the saturated colors in this and the simplicity of design.</td>', 'I really like the saturated colors in this and the simplicity of design.', '2004-10-28 16:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(977999, 114802, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very lovely image.</td>', 'Very lovely image.', '2004-10-28 16:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(978006, 114667, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the text on the boat/barge.  It really pulls the eye away from the symetry of the crane booms.  Should have either cropped or cloned it out.  Lovely tones in your photo.</td>', 'Too bad about the text on the boat/barge.  It really pulls the eye away from the symetry of the crane booms.  Should have either cropped or cloned it out.  Lovely tones in your photo.', '2004-10-28 16:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(978012, 114963, 11738, '<td valign="top">Cool.  These look like scotch mints, but they look an awful lot like eggs.  Nice lighting to create all those shadows.  Highlights seem slightly blown out on some of the mints.</td>', 'Cool.  These look like scotch mints, but they look an awful lot like eggs.  Nice lighting to create all those shadows.  Highlights seem slightly blown out on some of the mints.', '2004-10-28 16:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(978033, 115152, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice work, great choice.  There seems to be a slight bluring on the bottom, and right edges, no deduction here, as it is hardly noticeable.</td>', 'Nice work, great choice.  There seems to be a slight bluring on the bottom, and right edges, no deduction here, as it is hardly noticeable.', '2004-10-28 17:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(978036, 114807, 21621, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, the reflections are the most obvious implied lines to me, but then the horizon is also an implied line here, great work.</td>', 'Excellent shot, the reflections are the most obvious implied lines to me, but then the horizon is also an implied line here, great work.', '2004-10-28 17:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(978039, 115198, 21621, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, might benefit from cropping out the nearest tree on the left, nice work.</td>', 'This is a great shot, might benefit from cropping out the nearest tree on the left, nice work.', '2004-10-28 17:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(978041, 114963, 21621, '<td valign="top">Great choice for implied lines, is it just me or are these eggs very oddly shaped?</td>', 'Great choice for implied lines, is it just me or are these eggs very oddly shaped?', '2004-10-28 17:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(978045, 114910, 21621, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I really like it.</td>', 'Great capture, I really like it.', '2004-10-28 17:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(978052, 115174, 21621, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, and well shot.   Seems a bit oversaturated, but not too much, nice work.</td>', 'Creative idea, and well shot.   Seems a bit oversaturated, but not too much, nice work.', '2004-10-28 17:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(978055, 115232, 21621, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, great choice for the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting composition, great choice for the challenge.', '2004-10-28 17:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(978057, 114667, 25486, '<td valign="top">I love the symmetry and the obvious implied lines.  I like the tones used and I like the simplicity of the shot.  Or should I say the almost simplicity because what I don''t like is the boat / ship in the foreground cluttering things up and partly obscuring the dock wall and cranes on the other side.  Also having the skyline almost exactly across the midpoint of the shot is not a good idea.  It also cuts the cranes in half.  I''m not sure if any of these things was within your control, (I wasn''t there), but if they were that''s how, in my opinion, the shot could have been improved.  Its still worth a six though, well done.</td>', 'I love the symmetry and the obvious implied lines.  I like the tones used and I like the simplicity of the shot.  Or should I say the almost simplicity because what I don''t like is the boat / ship in the foreground cluttering things up and partly obscuring the dock wall and cranes on the other side.  Also having the skyline almost exactly across the midpoint of the shot is not a good idea.  It also cuts the cranes in half.  I''m not sure if any of these things was within your control, (I wasn''t there), but if they were that''s how, in my opinion, the shot could have been improved.  Its still worth a six though, well done.', '2004-10-28 17:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(978061, 114777, 21621, '<td valign="top">Good idea, focus is a little soft, might benefit from including the shadows on the left.</td>', 'Good idea, focus is a little soft, might benefit from including the shadows on the left.', '2004-10-28 17:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(978064, 114956, 25486, '<td valign="top">OK, not the best entry for this challenge I''ve seen but I''ve always said its the lighting that can make or break a shot and you have good lighting here.  Imagine how dull this shot would have been if the sun had just been high in the sky.  Implied lines, yes, the line of the cloud, the path and the poles of course.  It could possibly have been improved by cropping tighter on the path and poles and loosing some of the space on the right, I know the tree is there but.... Also I''m not sure the runner adds anything to the shot either.  A nice 6 though. Good job.</td>', 'OK, not the best entry for this challenge I''ve seen but I''ve always said its the lighting that can make or break a shot and you have good lighting here.  Imagine how dull this shot would have been if the sun had just been high in the sky.  Implied lines, yes, the line of the cloud, the path and the poles of course.  It could possibly have been improved by cropping tighter on the path and poles and loosing some of the space on the right, I know the tree is there but.... Also I''m not sure the runner adds anything to the shot either.  A nice 6 though. Good job.', '2004-10-28 17:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(978065, 114787, 21621, '<td valign="top">At first glance I was lost, but after a second look get it.  Very creative aproach.</td>', 'At first glance I was lost, but after a second look get it.  Very creative aproach.', '2004-10-28 17:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(978070, 115234, 21621, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the balls seem a bit overexposed, also they tend to blend together.<br/>Maybe a little more space between them would help.</td>', 'Good idea, but the balls seem a bit overexposed, also they tend to blend together.Maybe a little more space between them would help.', '2004-10-28 17:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(978073, 115163, 25486, '<td valign="top">You will probably loose marks for the shot being so small, larger does have more impact.  However the colours are wonderful, the lighting is good, directional giving texture and depth to the shot.  Its well enough framed.  Perhaps I would not have included the first shadow across the road?  It looks a bit odd because we can''t see the tree that''s making the shadow, well only part of the top.  The implied lines are obviouly there, that road seems to go on for ever!  Rows of trees are an obvious topic but this is very well shot and composed so I give it a six, well done.</td>', 'You will probably loose marks for the shot being so small, larger does have more impact.  However the colours are wonderful, the lighting is good, directional giving texture and depth to the shot.  Its well enough framed.  Perhaps I would not have included the first shadow across the road?  It looks a bit odd because we can''t see the tree that''s making the shadow, well only part of the top.  The implied lines are obviouly there, that road seems to go on for ever!  Rows of trees are an obvious topic but this is very well shot and composed so I give it a six, well done.', '2004-10-28 17:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(978079, 115281, 25486, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot.  Implied lines yes.  Not being able to see the front of the last car is anoying, I suspect its to crop out background distraction?  The background is still slightly distracting, the partial wording on the sign could have been removed I think?  I like the angle at which its framed. I like tighly cropped shots that fill the frame but I think this is a little to tight and I find it slightly frustrating that I can''t see as much as I would like to.  A six though, thanks for that,well done.</td>', 'A very interesting shot.  Implied lines yes.  Not being able to see the front of the last car is anoying, I suspect its to crop out background distraction?  The background is still slightly distracting, the partial wording on the sign could have been removed I think?  I like the angle at which its framed. I like tighly cropped shots that fill the frame but I think this is a little to tight and I find it slightly frustrating that I can''t see as much as I would like to.  A six though, thanks for that,well done.', '2004-10-28 17:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(978086, 113926, 25486, '<td valign="top">I just love the pure simplicity of the shot.  It is said tht you shouldn''t cut you photo in half like this but I think it works here.  The cloud is perfectly placed, again in middle where its not supposed to be.  The colours are sumptuous, great depth of field.  Its an inspiration for photography as pure art. I''m going to up my score to a seven, the first time I''ve done that, well done.</td>', 'I just love the pure simplicity of the shot.  It is said tht you shouldn''t cut you photo in half like this but I think it works here.  The cloud is perfectly placed, again in middle where its not supposed to be.  The colours are sumptuous, great depth of field.  Its an inspiration for photography as pure art. I''m going to up my score to a seven, the first time I''ve done that, well done.', '2004-10-28 18:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(978091, 114480, 25486, '<td valign="top">More trees, they are an obvious subject.  I''m not complaining though, this is very well done.  The painted, glowing effect makes it stand out.  Obvious implied lines.  The only thing for me that detracts from the shot is the spacing of the first tree on the left, is not the same as the others and the space around it keeps drawing my eye away from the rest of the image.  Not your fault I know, unless you grew the trees, which I doubt.  I gave it a six, well done.</td>', 'More trees, they are an obvious subject.  I''m not complaining though, this is very well done.  The painted, glowing effect makes it stand out.  Obvious implied lines.  The only thing for me that detracts from the shot is the spacing of the first tree on the left, is not the same as the others and the space around it keeps drawing my eye away from the rest of the image.  Not your fault I know, unless you grew the trees, which I doubt.  I gave it a six, well done.', '2004-10-28 18:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(978094, 114929, 25486, '<td valign="top">I may be wrong but this looks like a slwo sync shot?  The foreground is a bit stark and washed out by the flash for my taste.  I realise you were probably trying to get a balance between that and the background. Of course I could be totally wrong here.  Anyway the effect is still there.  The sunset is fabulous.  Well spotted, I gave it a six.</td>', 'I may be wrong but this looks like a slwo sync shot?  The foreground is a bit stark and washed out by the flash for my taste.  I realise you were probably trying to get a balance between that and the background. Of course I could be totally wrong here.  Anyway the effect is still there.  The sunset is fabulous.  Well spotted, I gave it a six.', '2004-10-28 18:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(978097, 115263, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nicely cropped, implied lines or actual lines???  I still like it.  The foreground is a bit cluttered, I don''t know if you could have taken the shot from another viewpoint with less clutter?  I six from me, well done.</td>', 'Nicely cropped, implied lines or actual lines???  I still like it.  The foreground is a bit cluttered, I don''t know if you could have taken the shot from another viewpoint with less clutter?  I six from me, well done.', '2004-10-28 18:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(978099, 114597, 25486, '<td valign="top">The implied lines are not as obvious in this shot as in some of the others but they are there.  It looks as of the image has been oversharpened, or is that some other intentional process?  What makes this shot for me is the colours and the lighting, which both combine to give the shot depth.  The fence posts and the tracks lead you into the shot, the patches of light and shade break up the middle ground so it doesn''t look boring or empty, by then you are into the trees and the far trees on the hillside.  Good work a six from me.</td>', 'The implied lines are not as obvious in this shot as in some of the others but they are there.  It looks as of the image has been oversharpened, or is that some other intentional process?  What makes this shot for me is the colours and the lighting, which both combine to give the shot depth.  The fence posts and the tracks lead you into the shot, the patches of light and shade break up the middle ground so it doesn''t look boring or empty, by then you are into the trees and the far trees on the hillside.  Good work a six from me.', '2004-10-28 18:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(978101, 115348, 16046, '<td valign="top">Really cool image.</td>', 'Really cool image.', '2004-10-28 18:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(978102, 114963, 16046, '<td valign="top">innovative lighting from multi light sources make this work, great pattern.</td>', 'innovative lighting from multi light sources make this work, great pattern.', '2004-10-28 18:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(978103, 114022, 16046, '<td valign="top">some bush there, well done</td>', 'some bush there, well done', '2004-10-28 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(978104, 115067, 16046, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, well done</td>', 'Awesome shot, well done', '2004-10-28 18:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(978105, 115338, 25486, '<td valign="top">Quality image, selective desaturation works very well here.  The implied lines are not the main part of the image though, or don''t really play a vital role in the make up of the imge.  The colour difference and the textures are what makes this image.  A six from me, well done.</td>', 'Quality image, selective desaturation works very well here.  The implied lines are not the main part of the image though, or don''t really play a vital role in the make up of the imge.  The colour difference and the textures are what makes this image.  A six from me, well done.', '2004-10-28 18:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(978108, 114819, 25486, '<td valign="top">Good lines, nice colours, exposure etc. I''m not sure straight on is the best angle, did you explore other angles?  Almost straight on makes it difficult to do anything else with the image creatively I mean.  How about from one side and experiment with DOF?  A six anyway from me.</td>', 'Good lines, nice colours, exposure etc. I''m not sure straight on is the best angle, did you explore other angles?  Almost straight on makes it difficult to do anything else with the image creatively I mean.  How about from one side and experiment with DOF?  A six anyway from me.', '2004-10-28 18:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(978115, 115331, 28656, '<td valign="top">Definitely not a perspecive that you''d normally see.  Pretty cool.</td>', 'Definitely not a perspecive that you''d normally see.  Pretty cool.', '2004-10-28 18:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(978121, 114932, 25486, '<td valign="top">Can''t miss the implied lines in this one!  Yep those lines are there.  Lots and lots of lines.  Going up and down and across.  Yep lines, and then there''s the ......err...the...errr...windows, yes the windows, in lines and lines.  <br/> <br/>Sorry I''m being facetious. I actually like this shot, how many would have ''seen'' this shot from looking at that building?  Ideal for this challenge. Spot on.  Its very powerful at first, quite an impact but it quickly becomes a bit boring when you realise that there''s nothing goig on at any of the windows, I''ve looked at them all.<br/> <br/>Having said that I don''t know how you could add interest, so I gave it a six.  Good shot though, I wouldn''t have been disapointed with it.</td>', 'Can''t miss the implied lines in this one!  Yep those lines are there.  Lots and lots of lines.  Going up and down and across.  Yep lines, and then there''s the ......err...the...errr...windows, yes the windows, in lines and lines.   Sorry I''m being facetious. I actually like this shot, how many would have ''seen'' this shot from looking at that building?  Ideal for this challenge. Spot on.  Its very powerful at first, quite an impact but it quickly becomes a bit boring when you realise that there''s nothing goig on at any of the windows, I''ve looked at them all. Having said that I don''t know how you could add interest, so I gave it a six.  Good shot though, I wouldn''t have been disapointed with it.', '2004-10-28 18:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(978123, 115198, 25486, '<td valign="top">Good night time shot, you could have entered it for the night time challenge?<br/> <br/>Obvious implued lines, nicely exposed, I think, maybe a little overdone?  Anyway a six from me, nice one.</td>', 'Good night time shot, you could have entered it for the night time challenge? Obvious implued lines, nicely exposed, I think, maybe a little overdone?  Anyway a six from me, nice one.', '2004-10-28 18:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(978124, 115215, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because of the unusual viewpoint.  I like to try and capture what others may not see in a scene.  The wheels, the forks, the spokes and the line of boots all go to make the shot what it is.  Nice lighting and exposure, the DOF is OK.  Pity about the other bikes in the background they detract from the rest of the shot. Its also tightly croped on the left but there''s a little empty space on the right which in my opinion upsets the balance a little.  A six from me, well done.</td>', 'I like this shot because of the unusual viewpoint.  I like to try and capture what others may not see in a scene.  The wheels, the forks, the spokes and the line of boots all go to make the shot what it is.  Nice lighting and exposure, the DOF is OK.  Pity about the other bikes in the background they detract from the rest of the shot. Its also tightly croped on the left but there''s a little empty space on the right which in my opinion upsets the balance a little.  A six from me, well done.', '2004-10-28 18:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(978132, 115138, 25486, '<td valign="top">I''ve a whole load of six''s to comment on and couldn''t wait to get to this one, I like it a lot, but, it could have been a 7, 8 or even a 9 for me.  Its obviously a long exposure to get the movement of the train and the people.  But do the sign and the seated people have a double image?  If it intentional, it doesn''t work for me.  If its camera shake then you should have used something to steady the camera.  Having those sharp would have made a much much better image in my opinion.  I have given it a six and I still like it.</td>', 'I''ve a whole load of six''s to comment on and couldn''t wait to get to this one, I like it a lot, but, it could have been a 7, 8 or even a 9 for me.  Its obviously a long exposure to get the movement of the train and the people.  But do the sign and the seated people have a double image?  If it intentional, it doesn''t work for me.  If its camera shake then you should have used something to steady the camera.  Having those sharp would have made a much much better image in my opinion.  I have given it a six and I still like it.', '2004-10-28 18:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(978144, 115234, 18834, '<td valign="top">I don''t necessarily understand the nature of the name, but great photo, 10</td>', 'I don''t necessarily understand the nature of the name, but great photo, 10', '2004-10-28 19:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(978155, 115120, 11793, '<td valign="top">maybe sharper or blurrier for the bacjground - this seems stuck in the middle.<br/> <br/>i like the posts very much. - good luck</td>', 'maybe sharper or blurrier for the bacjground - this seems stuck in the middle. i like the posts very much. - good luck', '2004-10-28 19:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(978159, 115262, 25486, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9, perhaps the highest score I''ve ever awarded.  I just love it!  I wish I''d taken it. There''s implied lines everywhere and geometric shapes all over the place.  My eyes never gets tired of looking at it.  The lighting is great, the lines, perspective and shapes just draw me in.  B&amp;W works well, what colour are those dark bands originally?  Excellent image, a very jealous 9, well done.</td>', 'I gave this a 9, perhaps the highest score I''ve ever awarded.  I just love it!  I wish I''d taken it. There''s implied lines everywhere and geometric shapes all over the place.  My eyes never gets tired of looking at it.  The lighting is great, the lines, perspective and shapes just draw me in.  B&W works well, what colour are those dark bands originally?  Excellent image, a very jealous 9, well done.', '2004-10-28 19:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(978210, 115044, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, lovely bold diagonal and lovely autumn colours.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, lovely bold diagonal and lovely autumn colours.', '2004-10-28 20:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(978224, 114022, 3087, '<td valign="top">That was a shock! A mohican pube! Interesting.</td>', 'That was a shock! A mohican pube! Interesting.', '2004-10-28 20:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(978231, 114932, 3087, '<td valign="top">Almost abstract in it''s repetitive geometric pattern - very interesting image. Would benefit from correction of parallel shift using Photoshop.</td>', 'Almost abstract in it''s repetitive geometric pattern - very interesting image. Would benefit from correction of parallel shift using Photoshop.', '2004-10-28 20:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(978235, 114970, 18191, '<td valign="top">This looks as though the ripples have been cloned in. It would have been a lot stronger with out them, but with a slightly better composition.</td>', 'This looks as though the ripples have been cloned in. It would have been a lot stronger with out them, but with a slightly better composition.', '2004-10-28 20:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(978236, 114978, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of shadow and colour to create strong abstract design.</td>', 'Great use of shadow and colour to create strong abstract design.', '2004-10-28 20:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(978237, 114836, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely vivid colours and lines to the left though the block of tree trunks on the right doesn''t work well for me.</td>', 'Lovely vivid colours and lines to the left though the block of tree trunks on the right doesn''t work well for me.', '2004-10-28 20:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(978239, 113926, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strong colour and form, simplicity works well here.</td>', 'Strong colour and form, simplicity works well here.', '2004-10-28 20:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(978242, 114874, 3087, '<td valign="top">Composition has a really strong impact for me. I love the very strong diagonals, the way the wonderfully even and repetitive ''line'' of the images diverges to the invisible convergence point just as the real lines do. Black and white is perfect for this shot.</td>', 'Composition has a really strong impact for me. I love the very strong diagonals, the way the wonderfully even and repetitive ''line'' of the images diverges to the invisible convergence point just as the real lines do. Black and white is perfect for this shot.', '2004-10-28 20:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(978243, 115198, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of lighting and colour to convey the ambience of this night time scene. This is a real postcard shot and I mean that in a positive way. I could certainly imagine choosing this as an image to stick into my diary as a memento of wonderful evenings walking these streets. Nice use of diagonals and verticals.</td>', 'Beautiful use of lighting and colour to convey the ambience of this night time scene. This is a real postcard shot and I mean that in a positive way. I could certainly imagine choosing this as an image to stick into my diary as a memento of wonderful evenings walking these streets. Nice use of diagonals and verticals.', '2004-10-28 20:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(978244, 114807, 3087, '<td valign="top">A stunning image though not sure which lines are implied and which are clearly seen. Lovely symmetry to the two silhouettes and great composition. Love the merged sky and water.</td>', 'A stunning image though not sure which lines are implied and which are clearly seen. Lovely symmetry to the two silhouettes and great composition. Love the merged sky and water.', '2004-10-28 20:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(978245, 115036, 3087, '<td valign="top">Black and white really suits this image and that cloud is incredibly imposing. The white of the cloud balances the pale lines of the pale layers of rock. Nice!</td>', 'Black and white really suits this image and that cloud is incredibly imposing. The white of the cloud balances the pale lines of the pale layers of rock. Nice!', '2004-10-28 20:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(978246, 115246, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very moody and atmospheric and also very enigmatic and intriguing. Like the small size of the model within the frame and the centred composition.</td>', 'Very moody and atmospheric and also very enigmatic and intriguing. Like the small size of the model within the frame and the centred composition.', '2004-10-28 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(978247, 114987, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure which lines are implied here... but an interesting image with a really quirky composition and feel to it.</td>', 'Not sure which lines are implied here... but an interesting image with a really quirky composition and feel to it.', '2004-10-28 20:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(978248, 114799, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a fascinating portrait. Would love a touch more light on her face though can appreciate that probably wasn''t possible. That''s a great background - what is it?</td>', 'What a fascinating portrait. Would love a touch more light on her face though can appreciate that probably wasn''t possible. That''s a great background - what is it?', '2004-10-28 20:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(978249, 115348, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and shadow and unusual but successful choice to go in close and lose the tops of the trees. Feels more intimate.</td>', 'Lovely light and shadow and unusual but successful choice to go in close and lose the tops of the trees. Feels more intimate.', '2004-10-28 20:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(978335, 114274, 28665, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, almost dreamlike.</td>', 'Nice lighting, almost dreamlike.', '2004-10-28 22:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(978338, 114807, 24065, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge -- I even like it better than my own!  10  Good luck</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge -- I even like it better than my own!  10  Good luck', '2004-10-28 22:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(978341, 115249, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  And it meets the challenge ;-)  Good luck</td>', 'Great photo!  And it meets the challenge ;-)  Good luck', '2004-10-28 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(978342, 115278, 28665, '<td valign="top">Serene - nice splash of colour in the center.</td>', 'Serene - nice splash of colour in the center.', '2004-10-28 22:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(978343, 115215, 28665, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, the colors match well I think.</td>', 'Nicely composed, the colors match well I think.', '2004-10-28 22:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(978345, 115246, 28665, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting, looks like a bad dream...</td>', 'Very interesting lighting, looks like a bad dream...', '2004-10-28 22:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(978346, 114859, 24065, '<td valign="top">I am so jealous of creative minds like yours!  This is so clever and so well executed!  Good luck :D</td>', 'I am so jealous of creative minds like yours!  This is so clever and so well executed!  Good luck :D', '2004-10-28 22:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(978347, 115317, 28665, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures.</td>', 'Very nice textures.', '2004-10-28 22:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(978353, 115281, 24065, '<td valign="top">Well focused, great colors, great implied lines.  The only thing I see that could be improved (in my rank amateur opinion) would be to take the shot at an angle that would allow the cars to fill the entire frame.  The little background triangle at the top right corner is distracting, but certainly not enough to keep me from giving it a good score.  Good luck on your entry.</td>', 'Well focused, great colors, great implied lines.  The only thing I see that could be improved (in my rank amateur opinion) would be to take the shot at an angle that would allow the cars to fill the entire frame.  The little background triangle at the top right corner is distracting, but certainly not enough to keep me from giving it a good score.  Good luck on your entry.', '2004-10-28 22:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(978357, 114742, 24065, '<td valign="top">WoW!  How blessed you were to have a day like this during the challenge.  Very nice.  I really like the dark contrasting lines in front.</td>', 'WoW!  How blessed you were to have a day like this during the challenge.  Very nice.  I really like the dark contrasting lines in front.', '2004-10-28 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
