(978540, 114956, 18234, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting on this one.  The jogger is a nice touch, but he competes with the poles a little much.  Framing him on the other side would balance the picture a little better.</td>', 'Love the lighting on this one.  The jogger is a nice touch, but he competes with the poles a little much.  Framing him on the other side would balance the picture a little better.', '2004-10-29 01:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
