(978720, 115128, 24128, '<td valign="top">I like the way you resisted the use of a ripe banana, also the exclusion of the Taj Mahal seems to benefit this photo. I''m sure that if this pic was better then it would get a higher mark, but conversly it does achieve a greater score than if it was worse. Also, good use of the non 90 clockwise degrees rotation - well done - 8</td>', 'I like the way you resisted the use of a ripe banana, also the exclusion of the Taj Mahal seems to benefit this photo. I''m sure that if this pic was better then it would get a higher mark, but conversly it does achieve a greater score than if it was worse. Also, good use of the non 90 clockwise degrees rotation - well done - 8', '2004-10-29 04:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(978722, 115281, 19708, '<td valign="top">In a word - WOW!<br/>An explosion of color and art all in one. You have captured this challenge well and applaud you for your composition and great eye and camera alignment here.<br/>One of my favorites in this challenge and truely deserving of a ((10))</td>', 'In a word - WOW!An explosion of color and art all in one. You have captured this challenge well and applaud you for your composition and great eye and camera alignment here.One of my favorites in this challenge and truely deserving of a ((10))', '2004-10-29 04:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
