(978785, 114350, 16046, '<td valign="top">How weird, reminds me of old James Bond movies. You have an excellent eye and the composition is outstanding, this is the coolest image in the challenge. I love the smoke/clouds. You get my 10.</td>', 'How weird, reminds me of old James Bond movies. You have an excellent eye and the composition is outstanding, this is the coolest image in the challenge. I love the smoke/clouds. You get my 10.', '2004-10-29 06:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
