(978871, 115214, 18191, '<td valign="top">A winner without any doubt. (is this from the University of Miami?), i might be crazy though...but insane or not, i can tell that this is a great photograph--great tone and composition...Good Luck! 10</td>', 'A winner without any doubt. (is this from the University of Miami?), i might be crazy though...but insane or not, i can tell that this is a great photograph--great tone and composition...Good Luck! 10', '2004-10-29 08:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(978895, 115038, 20204, '<td valign="top">The angle on the right of the frame is awkward.  With such a wide angle up close you need some form of perspective control in post editing, otherwise you need to get the subject further from the frame''s edges so they''re not as distorted.</td>', 'The angle on the right of the frame is awkward.  With such a wide angle up close you need some form of perspective control in post editing, otherwise you need to get the subject further from the frame''s edges so they''re not as distorted.', '2004-10-29 08:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(978896, 114590, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the subtlety of this image.  It''s a tree line, yet you have to look for it.  Well done!</td>', 'I like the subtlety of this image.  It''s a tree line, yet you have to look for it.  Well done!', '2004-10-29 08:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(978898, 115223, 20204, '<td valign="top">Depth of field might be a bit too short for this image;  The background dots seem to be fading from focus in an awkward manner.  The lighting on the coffee mug is also a bit bright, and as a result competes for attention over the drops.  I like the use of space in the frame to lead your eye throughout the image.</td>', 'Depth of field might be a bit too short for this image;  The background dots seem to be fading from focus in an awkward manner.  The lighting on the coffee mug is also a bit bright, and as a result competes for attention over the drops.  I like the use of space in the frame to lead your eye throughout the image.', '2004-10-29 08:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(978899, 114954, 20204, '<td valign="top">The fall colors are great, but the overexposure on the road and sky is so extreme as to draw my attention to them rather than the beautiful foliage.</td>', 'The fall colors are great, but the overexposure on the road and sky is so extreme as to draw my attention to them rather than the beautiful foliage.', '2004-10-29 08:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(978902, 114986, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting persepctive.  I also like the yellowish background - makes for a unique image.</td>', 'Interesting persepctive.  I also like the yellowish background - makes for a unique image.', '2004-10-29 08:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(978903, 114587, 20204, '<td valign="top">A bit too underexposed for my tastes.</td>', 'A bit too underexposed for my tastes.', '2004-10-29 08:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(978906, 115357, 20204, '<td valign="top">The border seems to be competing with the image for my attention.  I''m also not drawing any mental lines in this one as the buildings are different in shape / height.  That''s not reflected in my scoring, but wanted to let you know that I wasn''t feeling this image on the theme as strongly as others.</td>', 'The border seems to be competing with the image for my attention.  I''m also not drawing any mental lines in this one as the buildings are different in shape / height.  That''s not reflected in my scoring, but wanted to let you know that I wasn''t feeling this image on the theme as strongly as others.', '2004-10-29 08:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(978909, 114859, 20204, '<td valign="top">Depth of field ran out a bit in the foreground, but creative background and perspective.  Well done!</td>', 'Depth of field ran out a bit in the foreground, but creative background and perspective.  Well done!', '2004-10-29 09:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(978910, 114807, 20204, '<td valign="top">Subtle implied lines...  I''m assuming the triangle formed by the two poles was your intent?  Works for me.  I like the use of space to emphasize the subject''s solitude.  Also like the blending of water and sky tones.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Subtle implied lines...  I''m assuming the triangle formed by the two poles was your intent?  Works for me.  I like the use of space to emphasize the subject''s solitude.  Also like the blending of water and sky tones.  Nicely composed.', '2004-10-29 09:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(978915, 115064, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, good lighting, but I''m not liking the perspective.  I think a straight-on shot would have focused my attention on the lines more than the angle of the subject.</td>', 'Interesting subject, good lighting, but I''m not liking the perspective.  I think a straight-on shot would have focused my attention on the lines more than the angle of the subject.', '2004-10-29 09:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(978918, 115125, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect - it almost makes me dizzy.</td>', 'Interesting effect - it almost makes me dizzy.', '2004-10-29 09:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(978920, 115262, 20204, '<td valign="top">A bit of overexposure on the left foreground pillar bottom and not quite enough light hitting the background pillars.  Seems like this shot could be improved by taking earlier in the AM or later at night...  Or with some technical lighting.  Definitely meets the challenge theme though.</td>', 'A bit of overexposure on the left foreground pillar bottom and not quite enough light hitting the background pillars.  Seems like this shot could be improved by taking earlier in the AM or later at night...  Or with some technical lighting.  Definitely meets the challenge theme though.', '2004-10-29 09:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(978921, 115263, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a lack of sharpness in this image, and I''m struggling to find the subject in all the business.</td>', 'Seems to be a lack of sharpness in this image, and I''m struggling to find the subject in all the business.', '2004-10-29 09:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(978922, 114586, 20204, '<td valign="top">Feels like th eimage is tilted counter-clockwise, and the center path isn''t lined up quite right.  The foreground branch also creates a significant distraction.  You nailed the theme though, and the colors in the foliage are very nice.</td>', 'Feels like th eimage is tilted counter-clockwise, and the center path isn''t lined up quite right.  The foreground branch also creates a significant distraction.  You nailed the theme though, and the colors in the foliage are very nice.', '2004-10-29 09:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(978924, 115044, 20204, '<td valign="top">Baeutiful colors, and I like the perspective you choce for this image.  I might suggest tilting the camera a bit so the tree trunks appear more parallel with the image frame sides.  By cropping out, or changing position such that the background / rightmost tree looses the whitespace it would also help to keep focus on the foliage line instead of the bright sky.  Only other thing I could suggest would be to wait for different lighting so the trees were more evenly lit.  Nice image!</td>', 'Baeutiful colors, and I like the perspective you choce for this image.  I might suggest tilting the camera a bit so the tree trunks appear more parallel with the image frame sides.  By cropping out, or changing position such that the background / rightmost tree looses the whitespace it would also help to keep focus on the foliage line instead of the bright sky.  Only other thing I could suggest would be to wait for different lighting so the trees were more evenly lit.  Nice image!', '2004-10-29 09:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(978926, 115347, 20204, '<td valign="top">The perspective would be difficult, but I would try to get the background trucks out of the frame, and possible clone out the yellow pole.  This one would benefit from a tripod or quicker shutter as there is a bit too much softness. Nice to see a creative interpretation of the theme.</td>', 'The perspective would be difficult, but I would try to get the background trucks out of the frame, and possible clone out the yellow pole.  This one would benefit from a tripod or quicker shutter as there is a bit too much softness. Nice to see a creative interpretation of the theme.', '2004-10-29 09:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(978928, 114819, 20204, '<td valign="top">Slight coutner-closkwise tilt, but I like the image overall.  I''d like to see this in a sepia or duotone to emphasize the shapes more than their individual tones.  Nice work!</td>', 'Slight coutner-closkwise tilt, but I like the image overall.  I''d like to see this in a sepia or duotone to emphasize the shapes more than their individual tones.  Nice work!', '2004-10-29 09:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(978929, 115204, 20204, '<td valign="top">A bit too heavy in the background shadows, and the path distracts from the flower lines.  Seems to be a bit of softness to the image - maybe motion blur or lack of sharpening.</td>', 'A bit too heavy in the background shadows, and the path distracts from the flower lines.  Seems to be a bit of softness to the image - maybe motion blur or lack of sharpening.', '2004-10-29 09:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(978931, 114802, 20204, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, great composition.  I''d like to see more sharpness / detail, but overall this is a great autumn image.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, great composition.  I''d like to see more sharpness / detail, but overall this is a great autumn image.', '2004-10-29 09:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(978934, 115246, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very gothic...  Not so much my style, but it really invites the eyes to explore all the detail.  Well done!</td>', 'Very gothic...  Not so much my style, but it really invites the eyes to explore all the detail.  Well done!', '2004-10-29 09:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(978940, 115312, 20204, '<td valign="top">It meets the theme, but I''m seeing so many distractions in the image that I can''t focus in on what you were really trying to share with me.  Was it the foliage turning color?  The stop sign at the end of the trail?  The fence?  The trail itself? The shadows?  For any one of these choices, there are things you could do to emphasize them and work on manipulating the viewer to share your specific perceptions.</td>', 'It meets the theme, but I''m seeing so many distractions in the image that I can''t focus in on what you were really trying to share with me.  Was it the foliage turning color?  The stop sign at the end of the trail?  The fence?  The trail itself? The shadows?  For any one of these choices, there are things you could do to emphasize them and work on manipulating the viewer to share your specific perceptions.', '2004-10-29 09:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(978943, 115230, 20204, '<td valign="top">I had to groan when I saw this image...  Glad I''m not the only one who''s world grows uglier as election day approaches :)</td>', 'I had to groan when I saw this image...  Glad I''m not the only one who''s world grows uglier as election day approaches :)', '2004-10-29 09:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(978944, 115235, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative...  Seems like the depth of field ran short in the foreground.</td>', 'Creative...  Seems like the depth of field ran short in the foreground.', '2004-10-29 09:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(978947, 115285, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great composition...  Wish I had this effect in my area - I''d love to have this in my portfolio.  I like the tree line under the "Wain" and the color is amazing.  I''m wondering if this is really how it looked, or if it was enhanced in PS for effect.  Either way, it''s a compelling image.</td>', 'Great composition...  Wish I had this effect in my area - I''d love to have this in my portfolio.  I like the tree line under the "Wain" and the color is amazing.  I''m wondering if this is really how it looked, or if it was enhanced in PS for effect.  Either way, it''s a compelling image.', '2004-10-29 09:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(978949, 115067, 20204, '<td valign="top">Feels like this image needs some sharpening to bring out more detail.  I''d like to see the middle posts closer to the foreground so there is detail in more area.</td>', 'Feels like this image needs some sharpening to bring out more detail.  I''d like to see the middle posts closer to the foreground so there is detail in more area.', '2004-10-29 09:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(978954, 115328, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition - I like the way it divides the frame into different colors and textures.  Almost makes the image work as an abstract because my focus is drawn not to individual details, but to overall effects.  Nice work!</td>', 'Interesting composition - I like the way it divides the frame into different colors and textures.  Almost makes the image work as an abstract because my focus is drawn not to individual details, but to overall effects.  Nice work!', '2004-10-29 09:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(978956, 115249, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the color treament in this - great image!</td>', 'I love the color treament in this - great image!', '2004-10-29 09:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(978958, 114988, 20204, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail...  You''ve either got tame birds or big glass - either of which I envy!</td>', 'Amazing detail...  You''ve either got tame birds or big glass - either of which I envy!', '2004-10-29 09:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(978959, 115163, 20204, '<td valign="top">Would like to see this image make better use of the available pixel size.  It''s too difficult to see detasil in this smaller size.</td>', 'Would like to see this image make better use of the available pixel size.  It''s too difficult to see detasil in this smaller size.', '2004-10-29 09:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(978961, 115327, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think lighting could be tweaked to better emphasize the snails.  The highlights on the leaf compete for my attention, and the detail in the background distracts somewhat as well.  I don''t have a specific idea because I''m no lighting guru, but it just seems that the snails are too close in visual strength to the surrounding details to make a strong subject.  It is a creative idea though!</td>', 'I think lighting could be tweaked to better emphasize the snails.  The highlights on the leaf compete for my attention, and the detail in the background distracts somewhat as well.  I don''t have a specific idea because I''m no lighting guru, but it just seems that the snails are too close in visual strength to the surrounding details to make a strong subject.  It is a creative idea though!', '2004-10-29 09:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(978962, 115339, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting "old picture" effect...  I like it!</td>', 'Interesting "old picture" effect...  I like it!', '2004-10-29 09:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(978964, 114824, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view and perspective - very creative idea.</td>', 'I like the point of view and perspective - very creative idea.', '2004-10-29 09:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(978966, 115315, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  This image creates a sense of anticipation...</td>', 'Very creative!  This image creates a sense of anticipation...', '2004-10-29 09:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(978968, 115218, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems to need some sharpening, but I like the idea...  I think a sepia tone would really bring out the emotion in this concept.</td>', 'Seems to need some sharpening, but I like the idea...  I think a sepia tone would really bring out the emotion in this concept.', '2004-10-29 09:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(978971, 114787, 27763, '<td valign="top">I love the title</td>', 'I love the title', '2004-10-29 09:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(978972, 115207, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot, although I don''t see this as implied lines...  There''s nothing for my mind to "fill in" as the hair makes real lines.  I''d like to see the lighting emphasize the foreground hair a bit more to make the background more left to the imagination.  Also might be nice to have the left of the frame cropped tighter, but it may have been difficult to fan the hair out that far to compensate.  Great work!</td>', 'Very creative shot, although I don''t see this as implied lines...  There''s nothing for my mind to "fill in" as the hair makes real lines.  I''d like to see the lighting emphasize the foreground hair a bit more to make the background more left to the imagination.  Also might be nice to have the left of the frame cropped tighter, but it may have been difficult to fan the hair out that far to compensate.  Great work!', '2004-10-29 09:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(978975, 114597, 20204, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail throughout the image, and the fenceline does a great job of leading the eye through the frame.  Great composition and lighting!</td>', 'Amazing detail throughout the image, and the fenceline does a great job of leading the eye through the frame.  Great composition and lighting!', '2004-10-29 09:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(978976, 113966, 20204, '<td valign="top">Desperately in need of sharpening...</td>', 'Desperately in need of sharpening...', '2004-10-29 09:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(978993, 114480, 20204, '<td valign="top">Yikes...  This seems to be over NeatImage''d or over-blurred.  The blown out path also seems awkward.  It''s a great composition, but I think it would be great without the artifical photoshopping.</td>', 'Yikes...  This seems to be over NeatImage''d or over-blurred.  The blown out path also seems awkward.  It''s a great composition, but I think it would be great without the artifical photoshopping.', '2004-10-29 10:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(978994, 115338, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice effect...  At first glance the fence is the subject, but a second glance is rewarded with a more delicate and interesting subject in the leaves.  Layering implied lines was a creative approach - well done!</td>', 'Nice effect...  At first glance the fence is the subject, but a second glance is rewarded with a more delicate and interesting subject in the leaves.  Layering implied lines was a creative approach - well done!', '2004-10-29 10:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(978996, 115237, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not implied so much as real...</td>', 'Not implied so much as real...', '2004-10-29 10:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(978997, 115333, 20204, '<td valign="top">This would be an exciting shot in the right light, but this lighting is a bit dull...</td>', 'This would be an exciting shot in the right light, but this lighting is a bit dull...', '2004-10-29 10:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(979007, 115255, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see what the implied lines are... These are very real lines.</td>', 'Not sure I see what the implied lines are... These are very real lines.', '2004-10-29 10:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(979009, 115344, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice highlighting of the subject with depth of field.</td>', 'Nice highlighting of the subject with depth of field.', '2004-10-29 10:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(979010, 114742, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative perspective - very nice use of foreground detail to add interest to the cloud lines.</td>', 'Creative perspective - very nice use of foreground detail to add interest to the cloud lines.', '2004-10-29 10:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(979018, 114906, 20204, '<td valign="top">I the track an implied line, or a real line?  I think real.  But, I also think this is an amazing image.  Great lighting, and Iike the softness of it.</td>', 'I the track an implied line, or a real line?  I think real.  But, I also think this is an amazing image.  Great lighting, and Iike the softness of it.', '2004-10-29 10:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(979020, 113954, 20204, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is creating distractions, and I''m not sure I see anything creative in this in terms of lighting, compositionetc.  It''s just a phone with the talk button in sharp focus.</td>', 'Depth of field is creating distractions, and I''m not sure I see anything creative in this in terms of lighting, compositionetc.  It''s just a phone with the talk button in sharp focus.', '2004-10-29 10:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(979025, 114400, 20204, '<td valign="top">Needs sharpening...  Great reflections.</td>', 'Needs sharpening...  Great reflections.', '2004-10-29 10:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(979030, 115254, 20204, '<td valign="top">Depth of field problems, and a generally unappealing subject of something that looks like a dirty gutter.  I don''t see implied lines, but rather real ones.</td>', 'Depth of field problems, and a generally unappealing subject of something that looks like a dirty gutter.  I don''t see implied lines, but rather real ones.', '2004-10-29 10:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(979037, 115152, 20204, '<td valign="top">Wow!  How can I compete with this kind of subject?  Great composition, and excellent detail throughout the image.  This looks like publishable work to me.</td>', 'Wow!  How can I compete with this kind of subject?  Great composition, and excellent detail throughout the image.  This looks like publishable work to me.', '2004-10-29 10:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(979043, 114970, 20204, '<td valign="top">There is a softness to this image which mutes detail.  If this were tack sharp of the subject I would have given it a 9.  I love the silhouette, and the artifacts of the oars on the water, and that composition carries the image to an 8 from me.  Very unique, and full of emotion - just needs a bit more sharpness.</td>', 'There is a softness to this image which mutes detail.  If this were tack sharp of the subject I would have given it a 9.  I love the silhouette, and the artifacts of the oars on the water, and that composition carries the image to an 8 from me.  Very unique, and full of emotion - just needs a bit more sharpness.', '2004-10-29 10:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(979046, 115198, 20204, '<td valign="top">Feels like the background is tilted to the left and the foreground is tilted to the right...  Ilusions from wide angle optics.  With some persepctive correction in photoshop this would be greatly improved.  Without it, the image still retains an excellent composition which leads your eye through the frame.</td>', 'Feels like the background is tilted to the left and the foreground is tilted to the right...  Ilusions from wide angle optics.  With some persepctive correction in photoshop this would be greatly improved.  Without it, the image still retains an excellent composition which leads your eye through the frame.', '2004-10-29 10:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(979052, 114350, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very creattive perspective, and a subject I''ve never seen anything like before.  The sepia like toning adds to the surreal effect.  Very well composed!</td>', 'Very creattive perspective, and a subject I''ve never seen anything like before.  The sepia like toning adds to the surreal effect.  Very well composed!', '2004-10-29 10:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(979056, 114836, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast between the trees in the right foreground.  With some different lighting and a bit more sharpening this would be an amazing image.</td>', 'Not enough contrast between the trees in the right foreground.  With some different lighting and a bit more sharpening this would be an amazing image.', '2004-10-29 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(979062, 115070, 20204, '<td valign="top">Motion blur is distracting in this image, but an interesting perspective and subject.</td>', 'Motion blur is distracting in this image, but an interesting perspective and subject.', '2004-10-29 10:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(979066, 115330, 8367, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful with great tones.</td>', 'This is beautiful with great tones.', '2004-10-29 10:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(979072, 114719, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great find for the challenge. <br/>(It seems a bit dark...on my monitor.)</td>', 'Great find for the challenge. (It seems a bit dark...on my monitor.)', '2004-10-29 10:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(979151, 114825, 25388, '<td valign="top">good example of implied; the mind connects the dots.</td>', 'good example of implied; the mind connects the dots.', '2004-10-29 12:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(979157, 115274, 25388, '<td valign="top">the implied line of scrimmage. Well done. Maybe a little more angled left to avoid the white shirted spectator.<br/></td>', 'the implied line of scrimmage. Well done. Maybe a little more angled left to avoid the white shirted spectator.', '2004-10-29 12:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(979158, 115215, 25388, '<td valign="top">good implied line; backgound distracts a little.</td>', 'good implied line; backgound distracts a little.', '2004-10-29 12:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(979160, 115174, 25388, '<td valign="top">good interpretation of the challenge; I can see the implied line. Doesn''t mean my putt would drop from there though!! 9</td>', 'good interpretation of the challenge; I can see the implied line. Doesn''t mean my putt would drop from there though!! 9', '2004-10-29 12:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(979213, 115254, 11895, '<td valign="top">needs more depth of field so that more of the subject is in focus</td>', 'needs more depth of field so that more of the subject is in focus', '2004-10-29 13:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(979244, 114807, 27812, '<td valign="top">wish i could do that.... by far the best entry for me. yip, great work.</td>', 'wish i could do that.... by far the best entry for me. yip, great work.', '2004-10-29 13:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(979247, 115349, 27812, '<td valign="top">unhelpful comment removed<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 06:13:34.</i></td>', 'unhelpful comment removed', '2004-10-29 13:34:56.000000', '2005-10-05 07:13:34.000000', 1),
(979251, 114912, 27812, '<td valign="top">sharpness could have helped.</td>', 'sharpness could have helped.', '2004-10-29 13:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(979255, 114599, 27812, '<td valign="top">the white pole is hurting this pic, better cropping to focus on the horse-line would have made this a nice entry.</td>', 'the white pole is hurting this pic, better cropping to focus on the horse-line would have made this a nice entry.', '2004-10-29 13:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(979259, 114934, 27812, '<td valign="top">not bad, really, i just feel the overexposed sky takes away your advantage.</td>', 'not bad, really, i just feel the overexposed sky takes away your advantage.', '2004-10-29 13:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(979260, 113954, 27812, '<td valign="top">over-use of depth of field. good idea though.</td>', 'over-use of depth of field. good idea though.', '2004-10-29 13:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(979263, 114777, 27812, '<td valign="top">good idea gone bad....:) shadows not doing you any good</td>', 'good idea gone bad....:) shadows not doing you any good', '2004-10-29 13:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(979265, 115163, 27812, '<td valign="top">changing my mind, not a bad pic after all. cropping it to have a more solid upper corners, imo, would have helped.</td>', 'changing my mind, not a bad pic after all. cropping it to have a more solid upper corners, imo, would have helped.', '2004-10-29 13:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(979267, 114391, 27812, '<td valign="top">focus should have been on the rainbow. great idea though.</td>', 'focus should have been on the rainbow. great idea though.', '2004-10-29 13:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(979268, 114847, 27812, '<td valign="top">you could hve tried from another angle. good subject, though.</td>', 'you could hve tried from another angle. good subject, though.', '2004-10-29 13:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(979272, 114274, 27812, '<td valign="top">why so small... great pic, would have done better if bigger.</td>', 'why so small... great pic, would have done better if bigger.', '2004-10-29 13:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(979328, 114935, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Strength of challenge link</b>: strong<br/> <br/><b>Image</b>: there are lots of real lines here too but the implied lines are also very strong in the mountain ridges, crests and peaks. I love this shot as a standalone image. It''s a stunning scene which begs the wquestion: would it look good shot by most people, much the same as the Grand Canyon? I actually think you''ve chosen a great view with some nice foreground so I suspect that this is out of the ordinary.  : )<br/> <br/>It''s deep, fantastically detailed, rich in interest and quite mesmerising. Excellent. : )</td>', 'Strength of challenge link: strong Image: there are lots of real lines here too but the implied lines are also very strong in the mountain ridges, crests and peaks. I love this shot as a standalone image. It''s a stunning scene which begs the wquestion: would it look good shot by most people, much the same as the Grand Canyon? I actually think you''ve chosen a great view with some nice foreground so I suspect that this is out of the ordinary.  : ) It''s deep, fantastically detailed, rich in interest and quite mesmerising. Excellent. : )', '2004-10-29 14:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(979332, 114787, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Strength of challenge link</b>: strong<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: simply stunning. A great take on the challenge and absolutely bang-on. Hope it wins a ribbon. These clouds are wonderfult o behold and you''ve chosen the composition well. Good light, texture and detail.</td>', 'Strength of challenge link: strong Image critique: simply stunning. A great take on the challenge and absolutely bang-on. Hope it wins a ribbon. These clouds are wonderfult o behold and you''ve chosen the composition well. Good light, texture and detail.', '2004-10-29 14:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(979354, 115201, 18799, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photograph. They way the light poles on either side lead the eye to the mountain in the distance is very good.  I also like the symetry  of the stop lights.  My only nit is that the image is a little flat.   8</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photograph. They way the light poles on either side lead the eye to the mountain in the distance is very good.  I also like the symetry  of the stop lights.  My only nit is that the image is a little flat.   8', '2004-10-29 14:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(979358, 115267, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the challenge interpretation.  Really cool architecture shot.  My only nit would be to brighten it up a bit with an adjustment level.   8</td>', 'Nice job with the challenge interpretation.  Really cool architecture shot.  My only nit would be to brighten it up a bit with an adjustment level.   8', '2004-10-29 14:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(979363, 114963, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Strength of challenge link</b>: strong<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: Nice lighting and shadows - a little too strong towards the back though - and I think an even spread is important in this kind of shot, which is quite reliant and consistent form and appearance. The DOF is a bit too shallow also, so a longer shutter speed with focus 2/3 back would achieve full focal on all eggs.</td>', 'Strength of challenge link: strong Image critique: Nice lighting and shadows - a little too strong towards the back though - and I think an even spread is important in this kind of shot, which is quite reliant and consistent form and appearance. The DOF is a bit too shallow also, so a longer shutter speed with focus 2/3 back would achieve full focal on all eggs.', '2004-10-29 14:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(979366, 115189, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nicely observed and a quirky, fun shot an a quite dull challenge. Good focus and compo too.</td>', 'Very nicely observed and a quirky, fun shot an a quite dull challenge. Good focus and compo too.', '2004-10-29 14:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(979391, 114802, 8860, '<td valign="top">Now this is more like it - I was beginnning to lose the will to live voting on this challenge!!<br/> <br/>Lovely observation and an excellent effort to present an appealing subject as well as meet the brief. The viewpoint and compsoition is great. Image is a touch soft, but I hope you''re up near the top with this.</td>', 'Now this is more like it - I was beginnning to lose the will to live voting on this challenge!! Lovely observation and an excellent effort to present an appealing subject as well as meet the brief. The viewpoint and compsoition is great. Image is a touch soft, but I hope you''re up near the top with this.', '2004-10-29 14:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(979401, 114970, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great observation and nice subtlety in the lines. You did well to pull back, opening the shot to show the rower''s solitude.</td>', 'Great observation and nice subtlety in the lines. You did well to pull back, opening the shot to show the rower''s solitude.', '2004-10-29 14:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(979404, 115074, 8860, '<td valign="top">I obviously see the lines, but I wonder how interesting this shot is aside of the challenge. In my view if you can produce an image that is printable or hangable then you have achieved something more than simply meet the voters'' satisfaction.</td>', 'I obviously see the lines, but I wonder how interesting this shot is aside of the challenge. In my view if you can produce an image that is printable or hangable then you have achieved something more than simply meet the voters'' satisfaction.', '2004-10-29 14:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(979407, 115355, 8860, '<td valign="top">I would have infinitely preferred this shot without the coffee beans. It was dynamic enough and would have had less of a ''set-up'' feel. There many implied lines anyway so this is guilding the lily a bit!</td>', 'I would have infinitely preferred this shot without the coffee beans. It was dynamic enough and would have had less of a ''set-up'' feel. There many implied lines anyway so this is guilding the lily a bit!', '2004-10-29 15:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(979448, 115278, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I just don''t see many implied lines in this photograph.  Plenty of actual lines, in the trees. However, the trees themselves don''t give any sense of implicated line.. (such as they would if they were naturally or artifically lined up). Your exposure is also a touch dark and focus a touch off.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I just don''t see many implied lines in this photograph.  Plenty of actual lines, in the trees. However, the trees themselves don''t give any sense of implicated line.. (such as they would if they were naturally or artifically lined up). Your exposure is also a touch dark and focus a touch off.', '2004-10-29 15:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(979454, 114777, 93, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got the implied lines well, however, the photograph itself is difficult for me to look at.  I find it oversharpened, far too over-exposed (especially the background), and off-focus, which are three primary elements in a still.  Also, I''d suggest spacing the subjects further apart, which would have given the shot a little more dynamic.  A shot like this can really benefit from not having the negative space around the sides and back.</td>', 'I think you''ve got the implied lines well, however, the photograph itself is difficult for me to look at.  I find it oversharpened, far too over-exposed (especially the background), and off-focus, which are three primary elements in a still.  Also, I''d suggest spacing the subjects further apart, which would have given the shot a little more dynamic.  A shot like this can really benefit from not having the negative space around the sides and back.', '2004-10-29 15:41:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(979456, 115074, 93, '<td valign="top">More "actual lines" than anything implied in my opinion.  Your coloring also seems to be a little muted and flat to me, making the shot a little uninteresting.</td>', 'More "actual lines" than anything implied in my opinion.  Your coloring also seems to be a little muted and flat to me, making the shot a little uninteresting.', '2004-10-29 15:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(979459, 115257, 93, '<td valign="top">The line of the bike rack(?) is certainly implied, but I think your post-processing needs a little work.  The colors are faded and muted (it *looks* as if you tried to work on it in curves, but I could be mistaken), focus is off, and there''s just something about the composition that just doesn''t appeal much.</td>', 'The line of the bike rack(?) is certainly implied, but I think your post-processing needs a little work.  The colors are faded and muted (it *looks* as if you tried to work on it in curves, but I could be mistaken), focus is off, and there''s just something about the composition that just doesn''t appeal much.', '2004-10-29 15:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(979460, 115309, 93, '<td valign="top">The waves in the water give a small connection to implied lines to me, but the photograph itself suffers from a number of technical flaws.  The composition of the ducks could have been centered a little more (would have liked to have seen more of the darker duck, as it''s just a distraction where it is), and the focus is off, giving it a very "snapshot" feel.</td>', 'The waves in the water give a small connection to implied lines to me, but the photograph itself suffers from a number of technical flaws.  The composition of the ducks could have been centered a little more (would have liked to have seen more of the darker duck, as it''s just a distraction where it is), and the focus is off, giving it a very "snapshot" feel.', '2004-10-29 15:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(979463, 114022, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting a ton of comments on this shot.  I just wanted to say you have a pretty brave model. (unless it''s you, then *you''re* brave, heh).  A good implied line, of a sort, but a technically weak photo, with blown highlights and, to me, too soft a focus.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting a ton of comments on this shot.  I just wanted to say you have a pretty brave model. (unless it''s you, then *you''re* brave, heh).  A good implied line, of a sort, but a technically weak photo, with blown highlights and, to me, too soft a focus.', '2004-10-29 15:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(979464, 115349, 93, '<td valign="top">Good humor.  I, however, have to vote you a 1 for being politically one-sided.  Had you put *both* the candidates in the bowl, and titled it "Flushing the Election Process", or something similar.. it would be an instant 10 ;)<br/> <br/>(btw, i''m kidding about the 1)</td>', 'Good humor.  I, however, have to vote you a 1 for being politically one-sided.  Had you put *both* the candidates in the bowl, and titled it "Flushing the Election Process", or something similar.. it would be an instant 10 ;) (btw, i''m kidding about the 1)', '2004-10-29 15:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(979466, 114781, 93, '<td valign="top">I''ll be the 80th person to comment with : "I can''t wait for this ()*#&amp;%)*#%&amp;)#*&amp;)#*%&amp;)*#%&amp;*)#%&amp;*)#%&amp;% election to be over, so that I don''t have to be deluged with political satire on the voting page of a photography website."</td>', 'I''ll be the 80th person to comment with : "I can''t wait for this ()*#&%)*#%&)#*&)#*%&)*#%&*)#%&*)#%&% election to be over, so that I don''t have to be deluged with political satire on the voting page of a photography website."', '2004-10-29 15:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(979469, 115138, 93, '<td valign="top">A lot of both implied and actual lines here, and I like the composition, but the over-exposure and camera shake (motion blur/focus), really take away from the strengths for me.  I suppose it''s hard to get no camera shake with an obviously long exposure (although I think you could have probably dropped the exposure significantly), while a train is rumbling by.</td>', 'A lot of both implied and actual lines here, and I like the composition, but the over-exposure and camera shake (motion blur/focus), really take away from the strengths for me.  I suppose it''s hard to get no camera shake with an obviously long exposure (although I think you could have probably dropped the exposure significantly), while a train is rumbling by.', '2004-10-29 15:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(979473, 115330, 93, '<td valign="top">Not really sure where the impled lines come in here.  There are a couple of instances (the clouds, perhaps the two buoys), but they aren''t exactly a major element.  The suns rays are more actual lines, but even they are pretty much secondary to the shot.   On the other hand, it''s really nice sunset photo.</td>', 'Not really sure where the impled lines come in here.  There are a couple of instances (the clouds, perhaps the two buoys), but they aren''t exactly a major element.  The suns rays are more actual lines, but even they are pretty much secondary to the shot.   On the other hand, it''s really nice sunset photo.', '2004-10-29 15:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(979475, 114825, 93, '<td valign="top">You''ve pretty much epitomized what this challenge means to me with this photograph, which is absolutely gorgeous.  If this isn''t a ribbon winner, I''m the Queen of Kamloops.<br/> <br/>My favorite of the challenge, and my only 10.   A stunning piece of work, and as I said, there are so many ways that this photo implies lines.. it''s almost criminal.</td>', 'You''ve pretty much epitomized what this challenge means to me with this photograph, which is absolutely gorgeous.  If this isn''t a ribbon winner, I''m the Queen of Kamloops. My favorite of the challenge, and my only 10.   A stunning piece of work, and as I said, there are so many ways that this photo implies lines.. it''s almost criminal.', '2004-10-29 15:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(979476, 115152, 93, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the better shots of the challenge.  An excellent find, and an excellent entry.</td>', 'Definitely one of the better shots of the challenge.  An excellent find, and an excellent entry.', '2004-10-29 15:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(979478, 115355, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a great entry.  The coffee beans marching to the mug add an element of humor that I love, and sets this photo apart from many others.  Both the beans, and the place-mat/surface are great examples of impled lines.</td>', 'This is a great entry.  The coffee beans marching to the mug add an element of humor that I love, and sets this photo apart from many others.  Both the beans, and the place-mat/surface are great examples of impled lines.', '2004-10-29 16:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(979479, 114868, 93, '<td valign="top">A strong entry (only flaw I see is a *slight* mis-focus at the top of the objects).  Great composition, I like the desat (really works here), and th reflections are beautiful.  Should be a high placer, if not a ribbon.</td>', 'A strong entry (only flaw I see is a *slight* mis-focus at the top of the objects).  Great composition, I like the desat (really works here), and th reflections are beautiful.  Should be a high placer, if not a ribbon.', '2004-10-29 16:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
