(980130, 115348, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is so dynamic. It has everything. It is simplistic yet has wonderful texture and detail. It has great complimentary colors and contrast. Each of the elements are perfectly spaced and it doesnt feel crowded.  You have just the right amount of grass.  The shape of the branches, the colors and the softness of the grass give it a surreal feel.  <br/> <br/>The border is a little bold for my taste, I think I would cut it down to about ½ of its current size.<br/>Absolutely excellent work. 9 - Gringo<br/></td>', 'This is so dynamic. It has everything. It is simplistic yet has wonderful texture and detail. It has great complimentary colors and contrast. Each of the elements are perfectly spaced and it doesnt feel crowded.  You have just the right amount of grass.  The shape of the branches, the colors and the softness of the grass give it a surreal feel.   The border is a little bold for my taste, I think I would cut it down to about ½ of its current size.Absolutely excellent work. 9 - Gringo', '2004-10-30 01:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
