(980770, 115355, 15920, '<td valign="top">I think the composition would have been stronger with a little more placemat, and a single line of beans (like ants) wrapping in a curve.  But, take that in the spirit it is intended, this is a great idea.  I really like like the POV from directly above the cup.</td>', 'I think the composition would have been stronger with a little more placemat, and a single line of beans (like ants) wrapping in a curve.  But, take that in the spirit it is intended, this is a great idea.  I really like like the POV from directly above the cup.', '2004-10-30 22:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(980778, 114787, 15920, '<td valign="top">Outstandingly clever title.  Made me understand</td>', 'Outstandingly clever title.  Made me understand', '2004-10-30 22:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(980780, 114934, 15920, '<td valign="top">Like the shot, but the extreme angle is a little too much.</td>', 'Like the shot, but the extreme angle is a little too much.', '2004-10-30 22:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(980811, 115337, 27293, '<td valign="top">I''d make this a horizontal shot.</td>', 'I''d make this a horizontal shot.', '2004-10-30 22:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
