(981104, 115349, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''m new to DPC, but I did read the rules and this one looks like it doesn''t qualify because it''s a composite. But it says it has been validated. Hmmm - that must mean you actually got a giant toilet and flushed Kerry! I''ll give you bonus points for that.</td>', 'I''m new to DPC, but I did read the rules and this one looks like it doesn''t qualify because it''s a composite. But it says it has been validated. Hmmm - that must mean you actually got a giant toilet and flushed Kerry! I''ll give you bonus points for that.', '2004-10-31 05:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
