(981763, 114836, 8860, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot, regardless of the challenge. I do feel that simply featuring a row of something has become rather typical in this one, but I love this image more than most as is contains more detail and multiple facets.<br/> <br/>Good point of view and powerful composition.</td>', 'A lovely shot, regardless of the challenge. I do feel that simply featuring a row of something has become rather typical in this one, but I love this image more than most as is contains more detail and multiple facets. Good point of view and powerful composition.', '2004-10-31 18:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(981765, 115152, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great subject and a nice shot. i always truggle with shots like this though: a great subject - but would it look great anyway? I don''t know whether to award many points for creativity here since it''s pretty much point and shoot at the amazing scene.<br/> <br/>It''s clear (over-sharp) and impressive, but in my view it lacks the input of creative flair to make it stunning. Will probably score well though.</td>', 'Great subject and a nice shot. i always truggle with shots like this though: a great subject - but would it look great anyway? I don''t know whether to award many points for creativity here since it''s pretty much point and shoot at the amazing scene. It''s clear (over-sharp) and impressive, but in my view it lacks the input of creative flair to make it stunning. Will probably score well though.', '2004-10-31 18:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(981766, 115239, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very appealing moody shot. There''s some strange colour hue going on with a  mixture of warm (top left) and cool greys (bottom right), so I don''t know if this is the weather condition or your processing.<br/> <br/>A little more texture in the shot would be nice - even some grain - and might assist the feeling drizzly, misty moisture in the air.</td>', 'Very appealing moody shot. There''s some strange colour hue going on with a  mixture of warm (top left) and cool greys (bottom right), so I don''t know if this is the weather condition or your processing. A little more texture in the shot would be nice - even some grain - and might assist the feeling drizzly, misty moisture in the air.', '2004-10-31 18:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(981771, 113926, 24642, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts in colour and DOF works well.</td>', 'Great contrasts in colour and DOF works well.', '2004-10-31 18:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
