(981789, 114781, 8860, '<td valign="top">For me this is a visual gag which doesn''t really attempt to compete - or appeal to an international audience. You probably don''t care though!  ; )</td>', 'For me this is a visual gag which doesn''t really attempt to compete - or appeal to an international audience. You probably don''t care though!  ; )', '2004-10-31 19:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(981791, 114022, 8860, '<td valign="top">That''s a very long set of eyelashes!<br/> <br/>The palid flesh tones here make me a feel a bit unwell and for me this is a bit unpalatable to look at. The lines are perhaps implied but also very literal so overall this doesn''t do it for me. Focus is too soft and background is a bit messy for a shot like this too.</td>', 'That''s a very long set of eyelashes! The palid flesh tones here make me a feel a bit unwell and for me this is a bit unpalatable to look at. The lines are perhaps implied but also very literal so overall this doesn''t do it for me. Focus is too soft and background is a bit messy for a shot like this too.', '2004-10-31 19:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(981797, 115200, 8860, '<td valign="top">As a set-up shot this is technically OK, but I have to ask ''why?''. Yes there are gallses in a row but this seems to be still life without purpose - other than to fit the challenge. I would prefer to see some meaning or intention behind the shot to make it hangable or at least a creative solution. <br/> <br/>It''s nicely lit and composed but otherwise there is nothing here to motivate me.</td>', 'As a set-up shot this is technically OK, but I have to ask ''why?''. Yes there are gallses in a row but this seems to be still life without purpose - other than to fit the challenge. I would prefer to see some meaning or intention behind the shot to make it hangable or at least a creative solution.  It''s nicely lit and composed but otherwise there is nothing here to motivate me.', '2004-10-31 19:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
