(981850, 114022, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Ah, the pudenda glorified ! very difficult to find the implied lines, but such a lovely entry should not be held too liable to be literal in the interpretation of the challenge. Bumping  up to 7 on artistic merit.</td>', 'returning for comments:Ah, the pudenda glorified ! very difficult to find the implied lines, but such a lovely entry should not be held too liable to be literal in the interpretation of the challenge. Bumping  up to 7 on artistic merit.', '2004-10-31 20:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
