(983629, 114874, 7889, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments. Yeh this was not too good  -  the top and bottom of the picutre should have been parallel but when I snapped it I was not even thinking about implied lines, if i had then i might have been a bit more careful!<br/> <br/>Thanks Kavey for making it one of your favs - it means a lot to me when someone picks one of my photos!<br/> <br/>:-)<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-01 15:36:13.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all your comments. Yeh this was not too good  -  the top and bottom of the picutre should have been parallel but when I snapped it I was not even thinking about implied lines, if i had then i might have been a bit more careful! Thanks Kavey for making it one of your favs - it means a lot to me when someone picks one of my photos! :-) ', '2004-11-01 15:35:23.000000', '2004-11-01 15:36:13.000000', 0),
