(984029, 114825, 11793, '<td valign="top">i understand now why i wasn''t overly impressed with this despite how much i thought it fit the theme, and was unique ( sort of ).<br/> <br/>i have a foliage shot saved at 65%, and i was very disappointed with the loss of fine details, even at that compression.<br/> <br/>44% compression is too bad.<br/> <br/></td>', 'i understand now why i wasn''t overly impressed with this despite how much i thought it fit the theme, and was unique ( sort of ). i have a foliage shot saved at 65%, and i was very disappointed with the loss of fine details, even at that compression. 44% compression is too bad. ', '2004-11-01 18:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
