(1021846, 115177, 8367, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments. I like the s in the water and considered that to be the most prominent implied lines. Also, I like the gravel banks. When I shot this photo I had in mind a comment from one of the threads (can''t remember who posted it) pertaining to "international appeal". Supposedly, blue and green tones with bodies of water and local scenery. Judging by the 64 5''s received, I guess I fell short.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments. I like the s in the water and considered that to be the most prominent implied lines. Also, I like the gravel banks. When I shot this photo I had in mind a comment from one of the threads (can''t remember who posted it) pertaining to "international appeal". Supposedly, blue and green tones with bodies of water and local scenery. Judging by the 64 5''s received, I guess I fell short.', '2004-11-19 09:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1037425, 115281, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very groovy colors! you''re putting out some great work lately, Kylie!</td>', 'Very groovy colors! you''re putting out some great work lately, Kylie!', '2004-11-30 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1057581, 115071, 29168, '<td valign="top">Un-freakin-believable. I love this image.</td>', 'Un-freakin-believable. I love this image.', '2004-12-11 18:45:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1058095, 114022, 29132, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrayal of a daring subject matter. The black on white and blue works well. This one deserved a 10, not a 4 -- but America''s "Red States" may not yet be ready for this type of image. Don''t let this stop you. This is one of my all-time favorite images and would love to see more DPC photographers take risks like this.</td>', 'Beautiful portrayal of a daring subject matter. The black on white and blue works well. This one deserved a 10, not a 4 -- but America''s "Red States" may not yet be ready for this type of image. Don''t let this stop you. This is one of my all-time favorite images and would love to see more DPC photographers take risks like this.', '2004-12-12 09:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
